    (573, N'LON', 30606547, N'LON-093', N'The Dark Door', N'Continuous Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Continuous', N'Only 1 monster can attack during each Battle Phase.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (574, N'LON', 15866454, N'LON-094', N'Spiritualism', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Return 1 Spell/Trap Card your opponent controls to the hand. This card''s activation and effect cannot be negated.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (575, N'LON', 5494820, N'LON-095', N'Cyclon Laser', N'Equip Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Equip', N'You can only equip this card to "Gradius". Increase the ATK of "Gradius" by 300 points. When the equipped "Gradius" attacks with an ATK that is higher than the DEF of a Defense Position monster, inflict the difference as Battle Damage to your opponent''s Life Points.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (576, N'LON', 7165085, N'LON-096', N'Bait Doll', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Target 1 Set card in the Spell & Trap Card Zone; reveal that target, force its activation if it is a Trap Card, then negate its effect if the activation timing is incorrect, and if you do, destroy it. (If it is not a Trap Card, return it face-down.) When this card resolves, shuffle it into the Deck instead of sending it to the Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (577, N'LON', 95286165, N'LON-097', N'De-Fusion', N'Quick-Play Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Quick-Play', N'Target 1 Fusion Monster on the field; return that target to the Extra Deck, then, if all the Fusion Materials that were used for its Fusion Summon are in your GY, you can Special Summon all of them.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (578, N'LON', 33550694, N'LON-098', N'Fusion Gate', N'Field Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Field', N'While this card is on the field: The turn player can Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from their Extra Deck, by banishing Fusion Materials listed on it from their hand or field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (579, N'LON', 69954399, N'LON-099', N'Ekibyo Drakmord', N'Equip Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Equip', N'The equipped monster cannot attack. Destroy the equipped monster at the end of its controller''s 2nd turn after this card is activated. At that time, this card is returned to the owner''s hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (580, N'LON', 6343408, N'LON-100', N'Miracle Dig', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'If 5 or more of your monsters are currently removed from play, return 3 of them to the Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (581, N'LON', 32437102, N'LON-101', N'Dragonic Attack', N'Equip Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Equip', N'This card can only be used to equip Warrior-Type monsters. The equipped monster is treated as Dragon-Type and increases the ATK and DEF of the equipped monster by 500 points.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (582, N'LON', 69832741, N'LON-102', N'Spirit Elimination', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'When monsters in the Graveyard are removed from play, remove monsters on your side of the field from play as substitutes. This card remains active until the end of the turn that it is activated. The substitutes remain removed from play.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (583, N'LON', 95220856, N'LON-103', N'Vengeful Bog Spirit', N'Continuous Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Continuous', N'Monsters cannot attack the turn they are Summoned.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (584, N'LON', 62279055, N'LON-104', N'Magic Cylinder', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'When an opponent''s monster declares an attack: Target the attacking monster; negate the attack, and if you do, inflict damage to your opponent equal to its ATK.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (585, N'LOD', 3078576, N'LOD-000', N'Yata-Garasu', N'Effect Monster', 200, 100, 2, N'WIND', N'Fiend', N'This card cannot be Special Summoned. This card returns to its owner''s hand during the End Phase of the turn it is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up. When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent, they skip their next Draw Phase.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (586, N'LOD', 53982768, N'LOD-001', N'Dark Ruler Ha Des', N'Effect Monster', 2450, 1600, 6, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'Cannot be Special Summoned from the GY. Negate the effects of monsters destroyed by battle with Fiend monsters you control.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (587, N'LOD', 80071763, N'LOD-002', N'Dark Balter the Terrible', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2000, 1200, 5, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'"Possessed Dark Soul" + "Frontier Wiseman"
A Fusion Summon of this monster can only be conducted with the above Fusion Material Monsters. When a Normal Spell Card is activated, negate the effect by paying 1000 Life Points. The effect of an Effect Monster that this monster destroys as a result of battle is negated.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (588, N'LOD', 16475472, N'LOD-003', N'Lesser Fiend', N'Effect Monster', 2100, 1000, 5, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'(This card is always treated as an "Archfiend" card.)
Banish any monster destroyed by battle with this card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (589, N'LOD', 52860176, N'LOD-004', N'Possessed Dark Soul', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 800, 3, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'You can Tribute this face-up card; take control of all face-up Level 3 or lower monsters your opponent currently controls.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (590, N'LOD', 89258225, N'LOD-005', N'Winged Minion', N'Effect Monster', 700, 700, 2, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'Tribute this face-up card. Select 1 face-up Fiend-Type monster on the field. Increase the ATK and DEF of the monster by 700 points as long as it remains face-up on the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (591, N'LOD', 15653824, N'LOD-006', N'Skull Knight #2', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1200, 3, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If you Tribute Summon a Fiend-Type monster by Tributing this monster, Special Summon 1 "Skull Knight #2" from your Deck. Then shuffle your Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (592, N'LOD', 42647539, N'LOD-007', N'Ryu-Kishin Clown', N'Effect Monster', 800, 500, 2, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'When this card is Summoned (including Flip Summon and Special Summon), select 1 face-up monster on the field and change its battle position.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (593, N'LOD', 88132637, N'LOD-008', N'Twin-Headed Wolf', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1000, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'While you control another Fiend monster, negate the effects of Flip monsters destroyed by battle with this card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (594, N'LOD', 14531242, N'LOD-009', N'Opticlops', N'Normal Monster', 1800, 1700, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'A one-eyed giant that serves the "Dark Ruler Ha Des", it skewers its enemies with its sharp horn, shattering them to pieces.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (595, N'LOD', 41925941, N'LOD-010', N'Bark of Dark Ruler', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'If a Fiend-Type monster you control battles, during the Damage Step: Pay LP (in multiples of 100 points), then target the opponent''s battling monster; that opponent''s monster loses that much ATK and DEF, until the end of this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (596, N'LOD', 77910045, N'LOD-011', N'Fatal Abacus', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Continuous', N'Each time 1 monster is sent from the field to the Graveyard, inflict 500 points of damage per card to the respective card owner''s Life Points.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (597, N'LOD', 14318794, N'LOD-012', N'Life Absorbing Machine', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Continuous', N'During your Standby Phase, gain Life Points equal to half of the total Life Points you paid during your last turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (598, N'LOD', 40703393, N'LOD-013', N'The Puppet Magic of Dark Ruler', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Select 1 Fiend-Type monster from your Graveyard. Remove from play monsters on your side of the field whose total Levels exactly equal the Level of the selected Fiend-Type monster. Then Special Summon the selected monster from your Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (599, N'LOD', 76297408, N'LOD-014', N'Soul Demolition', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Continuous', N'You can only activate this card''s effect when you have a Fiend-Type monster on your side of the field. Pay 500 Life Points to use this effect. Both players select 1 Monster Card from their opponent''s Graveyard. Remove the selected cards from play.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (600, N'LOD', 3682106, N'LOD-015', N'Double Snare', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Destroy 1 face-up card on the field that has an effect that negates Trap Cards'' effects.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08');
