    (621, N'LOD', 67957315, N'LOD-036', N'Spirit Ryu', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'During your Battle Step, if this card battles (Quick Effect): You can discard 1 Dragon monster to the GY; this card gains 1000 ATK/DEF until the end of the Battle Phase.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (622, N'LOD', 93346024, N'LOD-037', N'The Dragon Dwelling in the Cave', N'Normal Monster', 1300, 2000, 4, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'A huge dragon dwelling in a cave. It is horrible when it gets angry, although it is usually quiet. It is said to preserve certain treasures.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (623, N'LOD', 20831168, N'LOD-038', N'Lizard Soldier', N'Normal Monster', 1100, 800, 3, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'A beast soldier derived from dragons, it is small for a Dragon-Type. Moving very quickly, this monster is an excellent strategist.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (624, N'LOD', 66235877, N'LOD-039', N'Fiend Skull Dragon', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2000, 1200, 5, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'"Cave Dragon" + "Lesser Fiend"
(This card is always treated as an "Archfiend" card.)
A Fusion Summon of this card can only be done with the above Fusion Material Monsters. Negate the effects of Flip Effect Monsters. Negate any Trap effects that target this card on the field, and if you do, destroy that Trap Card.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (625, N'LOD', 93220472, N'LOD-040', N'Cave Dragon', N'Effect Monster', 2000, 100, 4, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned while you control a monster. This card cannot declare an attack unless you control another Dragon-Type monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (626, N'LOD', 29618570, N'LOD-041', N'Gray Wing', N'Effect Monster', 1300, 700, 3, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'Discard 1 card from your hand during your Main Phase 1. This monster can attack twice during the Battle Phase of this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (627, N'LOD', 55013285, N'LOD-042', N'Troop Dragon', N'Effect Monster', 700, 800, 2, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'If this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: Special Summon 1 "Troop Dragon" from your Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (628, N'LOD', 92408984, N'LOD-043', N'The Dragon''s Bead', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Continuous', N'Discard 1 card from your hand. Negate the effect of a Trap Card that targets 1 face-up Dragon-Type monster and destroy the Trap Card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (629, N'LOD', 28596933, N'LOD-044', N'A Wingbeat of Giant Dragon', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Return 1 Level 5 or higher Dragon-Type monster you control to the hand, and if you do, destroy all Spell and Trap Cards on the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (630, N'LOD', 55991637, N'LOD-045', N'Dragon''s Gunfire', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'If you control a Dragon monster: Activate 1 of these effects;
● Inflict 800 damage to your opponent.
● Target 1 monster with 800 or less DEF; destroy that target.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (631, N'LOD', 81385346, N'LOD-046', N'Stamping Destruction', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'If you control a Dragon monster: Target 1 Spell/Trap on the field; destroy that target, and if you do, inflict 500 damage to its controller.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (632, N'LOD', 27770341, N'LOD-047', N'Super Rejuvenation', N'Quick-Play Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Quick-Play', N'During the End Phase of the turn this card was activated, draw a number of cards equal to the combined number of Dragon monsters you discarded or Tributed from your hand or field this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (633, N'LOD', 54178050, N'LOD-048', N'Dragon''s Rage', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Continuous', N'Dragon-Type monsters you control inflict piercing Battle Damage when they attack a Defense Position monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (634, N'LOD', 80163754, N'LOD-049', N'Burst Breath', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'Tribute 1 Dragon-Type monster; destroy all face-up monsters on the field whose DEF is less than or equal to the ATK the Tributed monster had on the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (635, N'LOD', 17658803, N'LOD-050', N'Luster Dragon #2', N'Normal Monster', 2400, 1400, 6, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'This dragon feeds on emerald. Enchanted by this monster even when attacked, few people live to tell of its beauty.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (636, N'LOD', 44203504, N'LOD-051', N'Robotic Knight', N'Normal Monster', 1600, 1800, 4, N'FIRE', N'Machine', N'The Commander of Machine-Types, he serves the Machine King. He is famous for the way he controls his troops.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (637, N'LOD', 56369281, N'LOD-052', N'Wolf Axwielder', N'Normal Monster', 1650, 1000, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'Once it has started battle, this monster attacks fiercely and cannot stop.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (638, N'LOD', 83764996, N'LOD-053', N'The Illusory Gentleman', N'Normal Monster', 1500, 1600, 4, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'Wearing odd fashions, this gentleman is very fickle. He sometimes saves people and at other times commits crimes.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (639, N'LOD', 92421852, N'LOD-054', N'Robolady', N'Normal Monster', 450, 900, 3, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'A warrior fully covered with metal. It upgrades by fusing with "Roboyarou".', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
