    (648, N'LOD', 43586926, N'LOD-063', N'Twin-Headed Behemoth', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1200, 3, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was destroyed on the field and sent there this turn: You can Special Summon this card, but its ATK/DEF become 1000. You can only use this effect of "Twin-Headed Behemoth" once per Duel.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
