    (657, N'LOD', 38538445, N'LOD-072', N'Fushi No Tori', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 0, 4, N'FIRE', N'Winged Beast', N'This card cannot be Special Summoned. This card returns to the owner''s hand during the End Phase of the turn that this card is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up. When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent''s Life Points, increase your Life Points by an amount equal to the Battle Damage.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:08'),
    (658, N'LOD', 75923050, N'LOD-073', N'Super Robolady', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 1200, 500, 6, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'"Robolady" + "Roboyarou"
