    (685, N'LOD', 79575620, N'LOD-100', N'Injection Fairy Lily', N'Effect Monster', 400, 1500, 3, N'EARTH', N'Spellcaster', N'If this card attacks or is attacked, during damage calculation (in either player''s turn): You can pay 2000 LP once per battle; this card gains 3000 ATK during that damage calculation only.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:09'),
