    (889, N'MFC', 34029630, N'MFC-095', N'Pitch-Black Power Stone', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Continuous', N'Activate this card by placing 3 Spell Counters on it. Once per turn, during your turn: You can target 1 other face-up card on the field that you can place a Spell Counter on; remove 1 Spell Counter from this card, and if you do, place 1 Spell Counter on that target. When the last Spell Counter(s) is removed from this card, destroy it.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:09'),
