You take no Battle Damage from battles involving this card. When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard: Special Summon 1 "Mirage Knight" from your hand or Deck.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:09'),
