    (952, N'DCR', 28121403, N'DCR-050', N'Really Eternal Rest', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'Destroy all monsters equipped with an Equip Card(s).', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (953, N'DCR', 52824910, N'DCR-051', N'Kaiser Glider', N'Effect Monster', 2400, 2200, 6, N'LIGHT', N'Dragon', N'Cannot be destroyed by battle with a monster that has the same ATK. If this card is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard: Target 1 monster on the field; return that target to the hand.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (954, N'DCR', 36261276, N'DCR-052', N'Interdimensional Matter Transporter', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'Target 1 face-up monster you control; banish that target until the End Phase.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (955, N'DCR', 23265313, N'DCR-053', N'Cost Down', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Discard 1 card; for the rest of this turn, reduce the Levels of all monsters in your hand by 2 (even after they are Summoned).', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (956, N'DCR', 49003308, N'DCR-054', N'Gagagigo', N'Normal Monster', 1850, 1000, 4, N'WATER', N'Reptile', N'This young evildoer used to have an evil heart, but by meeting a special person, he discovered justice.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (957, N'DCR', 86498013, N'DCR-055', N'D.D. Trainer', N'Normal Monster', 100, 2000, 1, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'A poor goblin that was sucked into a different dimension. However, he''s doing his best with his new destiny.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (958, N'DCR', 12482652, N'DCR-056', N'Ojama Green', N'Normal Monster', 0, 1000, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'He''s one of the Ojama Trio. It''s said that he butts in by any means necessary. It''s also said that when the three are together, something happens.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (959, N'DCR', 49881766, N'DCR-057', N'Archfiend Soldier', N'Normal Monster', 1900, 1500, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'An expert at battle who belongs to a crack diabolical unit. He''s famous because he always gets the job done.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (960, N'DCR', 75375465, N'DCR-058', N'Pandemonium Watchbear', N'Effect Monster', 1300, 1800, 4, N'DARK', N'Beast', N'As long as this card remains face-up on your side of the field, "Pandemonium" on your side of the field is not destroyed by your opponent''s card effects.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (961, N'DCR', 11760174, N'DCR-059', N'Sasuke Samurai #2', N'Effect Monster', 200, 300, 1, N'WIND', N'Warrior', N'Once per turn, during your Main Phase, you can pay 800 Life Points. If you do this, until the End Phase, Spell and Trap Cards cannot be activated.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (962, N'DCR', 48768179, N'DCR-060', N'Dark Scorpion - Gorg the Strong', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1500, 5, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent, you can activate 1 of these effects:
● Target 1 monster your opponent controls; return that target to the top of the Deck.
● Send the top card of their Deck to the Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (963, N'DCR', 74153887, N'DCR-061', N'Dark Scorpion - Meanae the Thorn', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1800, 4, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent, you can activate 1 of these effects:
● Add 1 "Dark Scorpion" card from your Deck to your hand.
● Target 1 "Dark Scorpion" card in your Graveyard; add that target to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (964, N'DCR', 11548522, N'DCR-062', N'Outstanding Dog Marron', N'Effect Monster', 100, 100, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'When this card is sent to your Graveyard, add it to your Deck and shuffle it.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (965, N'DCR', 47942531, N'DCR-063', N'Great Maju Garzett', N'Effect Monster', 0, 0, 6, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'The ATK of this card becomes twice the original ATK of 1 monster that you Tributed for the Tribute Summon of this card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (966, N'DCR', 73431236, N'DCR-064', N'Iron Blacksmith Kotetsu', N'Flip Effect Monster', 500, 500, 2, N'FIRE', N'Beast-Warrior', N'FLIP: Add 1 Equip Spell from your Deck to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (967, N'DCR', 425934, N'DCR-065', N'Goblin of Greed', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1800, 4, N'EARTH', N'Fiend', N'As long as this card remains face-up on your side of the field, neither player can activate an effect by discarding from his/her hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (968, N'DCR', 46820049, N'DCR-066', N'Mefist the Infernal General', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1700, 5, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage. If this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: Make your opponent discard 1 random card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (969, N'DCR', 73219648, N'DCR-067', N'Vilepawn Archfiend', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 200, 2, N'EARTH', N'Fiend', N'The controller of this card pays 500 Life Points during each of his/her Standby Phases (this is not optional). When this card is targeted by the effect of a card controlled by your opponent, when resolving the effect, roll a six-sided die. If the result is 3, negate the effect and destroy the opponent''s card. As long as this card remains on the field, your opponent cannot attack any Archfiend Monster Card on your side of the field except "Vilepawn Archfiend".', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (970, N'DCR', 9603356, N'DCR-068', N'Shadowknight Archfiend', N'Effect Monster', 2000, 1600, 4, N'WIND', N'Fiend', N'The controller of this card pays 900 Life Points during each of his/her Standby Phases (this is not optional). When this card is targeted by the effect of a card controlled by your opponent, when resolving the effect, roll a six-sided die. If the result is 3, negate the effect and destroy the opponent''s card. The Battle Damage this card inflicts to your opponent is halved.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (971, N'DCR', 35798491, N'DCR-069', N'Darkbishop Archfiend', N'Effect Monster', 300, 1400, 3, N'WATER', N'Fiend', N'The controller of this card pays 500 Life Points during each of his/her Standby Phases (this is not optional). When an Archfiend Monster Card on your side of the field is targeted by the effect of a card controlled by your opponent, when resolving the effect, roll a six-sided die. If the result is 1, 3, or 6, negate the effect and destroy the opponent''s card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (972, N'DCR', 72192100, N'DCR-070', N'Desrook Archfiend', N'Effect Monster', 1100, 1800, 3, N'LIGHT', N'Fiend', N'The controller of this card pays 500 Life Points during each of his/her Standby Phases (this is not optional). When this card is targeted by the effect of a card controlled by your opponent, when resolving the effect, roll a six-sided die. If the result is 3, negate the effect and destroy the opponent''s card. When a "Terrorking Archfiend" on your side of the field is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, you can send this card from your hand to the Graveyard to Special Summon the "Terrorking Archfiend".', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (973, N'DCR', 8581705, N'DCR-071', N'Infernalqueen Archfiend', N'Effect Monster', 900, 1500, 4, N'FIRE', N'Fiend', N'The controller of this card pays 500 Life Points during each of his/her Standby Phases (this is not optional). When this card is targeted by the effect of a card controlled by your opponent, when resolving the effect, roll a six-sided die. If the result is 2 or 5, negate the effect and destroy the opponent''s card. As long as this card remains on the field, during each Standby Phase, increase the ATK of 1 Archfiend Monster Card by 1000 points until the End Phase.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (974, N'DCR', 35975813, N'DCR-072', N'Terrorking Archfiend', N'Effect Monster', 2000, 1500, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Flip Summoned unless you have an Archfiend Monster Card on your side of the field. The controller of this card pays 800 Life Points during each of his/her Standby Phases (this is not optional). When this card is targeted by the effect of a card controlled by your opponent, when resolving the effect, roll a six-sided die. If the result is 2 or 5, negate the effect and destroy the opponent''s card. The effects of an Effect Monster that this card destroyed as a result of battle are negated.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (975, N'DCR', 61370518, N'DCR-073', N'Skull Archfiend of Lightning', N'Effect Monster', 2500, 1200, 6, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'During each of your Standby Phases, you must pay 500 Life Points (this is not optional), or this card is destroyed. Before resolving an opponent''s card effect that targets this card, roll a six-sided die, negate the effect if you roll 1, 3, or 6, and if you do, destroy that card.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (976, N'DCR', 7369217, N'DCR-074', N'Metallizing Parasite - Lunatite', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 500, 7, N'WATER', N'Aqua', N'Once per turn, during your Main Phase, if you control this monster on the field, you can equip it to a face-up monster on your side of the field as an Equip Spell Card, OR unequip the Union equipment and Special Summon this card in face-up Attack Position. While equipped to a monster by this card''s effect, that monster will be unaffected by the effects of Spell Cards controlled by your opponent. (1 monster can only be equipped with 1 Union Monster at a time. If the monster that this card is equipped to is destroyed as a result of battle, destroy this card instead.)', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (977, N'DCR', 34853266, N'DCR-075', N'Tsukuyomi', N'Effect Monster', 1100, 1400, 4, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'Cannot be Special Summoned. If this card is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up: Target 1 face-up monster on the field; change that target to face-down Defense Position. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card was Normal Summoned or flipped face-up this turn: Return it to the hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (978, N'DCR', 82108372, N'DCR-076', N'Mudora', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1800, 4, N'EARTH', N'Fairy', N'This card gains 200 ATK for each Fairy-Type monster in your Graveyard.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (979, N'DCR', 80441106, N'DCR-077', N'Keldo', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 1600, 4, N'EARTH', N'Fairy', N'When this card is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard as a result of battle, select 2 cards from your opponent''s Graveyard, add them to your opponent''s Deck and the Deck is then shuffled.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (980, N'DCR', 54878498, N'DCR-078', N'Kelbek', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1800, 4, N'EARTH', N'Fairy', N'A monster that attacks this card returns to the hand. Damage calculation is applied normally.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (981, N'DCR', 16268841, N'DCR-079', N'Zolga', N'Effect Monster', 1700, 1200, 4, N'EARTH', N'Fairy', N'When a monster is Tribute Summoned by Tributing this card: The owner of this card gains 2000 Life Points.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (982, N'DCR', 16135253, N'DCR-080', N'Agido', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1300, 4, N'EARTH', N'Fairy', N'When this card is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard as a result of battle, roll a six-sided die. You can Special Summon 1 Fairy-Type monster from your Graveyard whose Level is equal to the number rolled. (If the result is 6, you can Special Summon a Level 6 or higher monster.)', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (983, N'DCR', 60258960, N'DCR-081', N'Legendary Flame Lord', N'Ritual Effect Monster', 2400, 2000, 7, N'FIRE', N'Spellcaster', N'This card can only be Ritual Summoned with the Ritual Spell Card, "Incandescent Ordeal". You must also Tribute monsters whose total Levels equal 7 or more from the field or your hand. Each time you or your opponent activates 1 Spell Card, put 1 Spell Counter on this card. Remove 3 Spell Counters from this card to destroy all monsters on the field except this card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (984, N'DCR', 97642679, N'DCR-082', N'Dark Master - Zorc', N'Ritual Effect Monster', 2700, 1500, 8, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Contract with the Dark Master". Once per turn: You can roll a six-sided die, then destroy all monsters your opponent controls if you roll 1 or 2, destroy 1 monster your opponent controls if you roll 3, 4 or 5, or destroy all monsters you control if you roll 6.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (985, N'DCR', 29228529, N'DCR-083', N'Spell Reproduction', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Send 2 Spells from your hand to the GY, then target 1 Spell in your GY; add it to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (986, N'DCR', 16435215, N'DCR-084', N'Dragged Down into the Grave', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Both players reveal their hands, each chooses 1 card from their opponent''s hand, then you discard the chosen cards from both players'' hands, then both players draw 1 card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (987, N'DCR', 33031674, N'DCR-085', N'Incandescent Ordeal', N'Ritual Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Ritual', N'This card is used to Ritual Summon "Legendary Flame Lord". You must also Tribute monsters whose total Levels equal 7 or more from the field or your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (988, N'DCR', 69035382, N'DCR-086', N'Contract with the Abyss', N'Ritual Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Ritual', N'This card can be used to Ritual Summon any DARK Ritual Monster. You must also Tribute monsters from your hand or field whose total Levels exactly equal the Level of the Ritual Monster you Ritual Summon.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (989, N'DCR', 96420087, N'DCR-087', N'Contract with the Dark Master', N'Ritual Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Ritual', N'This card is used to Ritual Summon "Dark Master - Zorc". You must also Tribute monsters from your hand or field whose total Levels equal 8 or more.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (990, N'DCR', 32919136, N'DCR-088', N'Falling Down', N'Equip Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Equip', N'Activate this card by targeting an opponent''s monster; equip this card to it. Take control of it. Destroy this card unless you control an "Archfiend" card. During each of your opponent''s Standby Phases: You take 800 damage.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (991, N'DCR', 69313735, N'DCR-089', N'Checkmate', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Tribute 1 Archfiend monster on your side of the field. During this turn, 1 "Terrorking Archfiend" on your side of the field can attack your opponent''s Life Points directly.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (992, N'DCR', 28106077, N'DCR-090', N'Cestus of Dagla', N'Equip Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Equip', N'Equip only to a Fairy-Type monster. It gains 500 ATK. If it inflicts battle damage to your opponent: Gain LP equal to the damage inflicted.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (993, N'DCR', 95308449, N'DCR-091', N'Final Countdown', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'Pay 2000 Life Points. After 20 turns have passed (counting the turn you activate this card as the 1st turn), you win the Duel.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (994, N'DCR', 22796548, N'DCR-092', N'Archfiend''s Oath', N'Continuous Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Continuous', N'Once per turn: You can pay 500 Life Points, then declare 1 card name; excavate the top card of your Deck, and if it is the declared card, add it to your hand. Otherwise, send it to the Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (995, N'DCR', 68191243, N'DCR-093', N'Mustering of the Dark Scorpions', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Normal', N'If you control a face-up "Don Zaloog": You can Special Summon any number of "Dark Scorpion" monsters from your hand, but only 1 copy of each.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (996, N'DCR', 94585852, N'DCR-094', N'Pandemonium', N'Field Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Field', N'Neither player has to pay Life Points during the Standby Phase for "Archfiend" monsters. Each time a player''s "Archfiend" monster(s) is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, except by battle, that player can add 1 "Archfiend" monster from their Deck to their hand that is a lower Level than the destroyed card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (997, N'DCR', 21070956, N'DCR-095', N'Altar for Tribute', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'Select 1 monster on your side of the field and send it to the Graveyard. Increase your Life Points by an amount equal to the original ATK of the monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (998, N'DCR', 57069605, N'DCR-096', N'Frozen Soul', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'You can only activate this card when your Life Points are at least 2000 lower than your opponent''s. Skip your opponent''s next Battle Phase.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (999, N'DCR', 94463200, N'DCR-097', N'Battle-Scarred', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Continuous', N'Select 1 Archfiend monster on your side of the field to activate this card. Your opponent also pays the same Life Points that you pay for the selected monster during the Standby Phase. If this card is removed from the field, destroy the selected monster. When the selected monster is removed from the field, destroy this card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10'),
    (1000, N'DCR', 20858318, N'DCR-098', N'Dark Scorpion Combination', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Normal', N'You can only activate this card when there are "Don Zaloog", "Cliff the Trap Remover", "Dark Scorpion - Chick the Yellow", "Dark Scorpion - Gorg the Strong", and "Dark Scorpion - Meanae the Thorn" face-up on your side of the field. During this turn, any of these 5 cards can attack your opponent''s Life Points directly. In that case, the Battle Damage inflicted to your opponent by each of those cards becomes 400 points.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:10');
