    (1342, N'CRV', 5606466, N'CRV-EN051', N'D.D. Trap Hole', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'When your opponent Sets exactly 1 monster (and no other cards): Target that Set monster and 1 monster you control; destroy those targets, and if you do, banish them.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1343, N'CRV', 5728014, N'CRV-EN052', N'A Rival Appears!', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Select 1 face-up monster your opponent controls. Special Summon 1 monster from your hand that has the same Level as the selected monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1344, N'CRV', 4483989, N'CRV-EN053', N'Prepare to Strike Back', N'Continuous Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Each time your opponent declares a face-up Defense Position monster as an attack target, toss a coin and call it. If you call it right, change the targeted monster to Attack Position. If you call it wrong, the controller of this card takes damage equal to the amount that the ATK of the attacking monster is higher than the DEF of the attack target.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1345, N'CRV', 70156997, N'CRV-EN054', N'Spiritual Earth Art - Kurogane', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Tribute 1 EARTH monster and target 1 other Level 4 or lower EARTH monster in your GY; Special Summon that EARTH monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1346, N'CRV', 32723153, N'CRV-EN055', N'Magical Explosion', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only while you have no cards in your hand. Inflict 200 damage to your opponent for each Spell Card in your Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1347, N'CRV', 78211862, N'CRV-EN056', N'Rising Energy', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Discard 1 card, then target 1 face-up monster on the field; that target gains 1500 ATK until the end of this turn.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1348, N'CRV', 67095270, N'CRV-EN057', N'Dimension Wall', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only when an opponent''s monster declares an attack. Instead of you, your opponent takes the Battle Damage you would have taken from this battle.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1349, N'CRV', 61850482, N'CRV-EN058', N'Level Modulation', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Your opponent draws 2 cards. Special Summon 1 "LV" monster from your Graveyard, ignoring the Summoning conditions. The monster that was Special Summoned by this effect cannot attack, nor activate or apply its effect this turn.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1350, N'CRV', 58392024, N'CRV-EN059', N'Mispolymerization', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only when a Fusion Monster is Special Summoned. Return all face-up Fusion Monsters to their respective Extra Decks.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1351, N'CRV', 90440725, N'CRV-EN060', N'Cyber Shadow Gardna', N'Continuous Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'During your opponent''s Main Phase: Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Machine/EARTH/Level 4/ATK ?/DEF ?). (This card is also still a Trap.) When an opponent''s monster declares an attack that targets this card: The ATK/DEF of this card become the ATK/DEF of the attacking monster. Once per turn, during your opponent''s End Phase: Set this card in its Spell & Trap Zone.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1352, N'EEN', 7459013, N'EEN-EN001', N'Zure, Knight of Dark World', N'Normal Monster', 1800, 1500, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'The name of this illustrious knight is known by all residents of Dark World. He never oppresses the commoners.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1353, N'EEN', 51638941, N'EEN-EN002', N'V-Tiger Jet', N'Normal Monster', 1600, 1800, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'This ace fighter is unbeatable in a dogfight. It combines with other monsters to launch an array of encircling attacks.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1354, N'EEN', 97023549, N'EEN-EN003', N'Blade Skater', N'Normal Monster', 1400, 1500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'An image of beauty on the ice, this gorgeous warrior rips her opponents into pieces with her stylish Accel Slicer attack.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1355, N'EEN', 25652259, N'EEN-EN004', N'Queen''s Knight', N'Normal Monster', 1500, 1600, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'This knight catches her opponents off guard, dominating them with swift yet graceful attacks.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1356, N'EEN', 90876561, N'EEN-EN005', N'Jack''s Knight', N'Normal Monster', 1900, 1000, 5, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'A strong master swordsman. His loyalty is to justice, his duty to protect the weak.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1357, N'EEN', 64788463, N'EEN-EN006', N'King''s Knight', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1400, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'When this card is Normal Summoned while you control "Queen''s Knight": You can Special Summon 1 "Jack''s Knight" from your Deck.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1358, N'EEN', 59793705, N'EEN-EN007', N'Elemental HERO Bladedge', N'Effect Monster', 2600, 1800, 7, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1359, N'EEN', 86188410, N'EEN-EN008', N'Elemental HERO Wildheart', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1600, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'Unaffected by Trap effects.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1360, N'EEN', 23421244, N'EEN-EN009', N'Reborn Zombie', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1600, 4, N'DARK', N'Zombie', N'While you have no cards in your hand and this card is in Attack Position, it cannot be destroyed by battle.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1361, N'EEN', 50916353, N'EEN-EN010', N'Chthonian Soldier', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 1400, 4, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'When this card is destroyed by an opponent''s attacking monster and sent to the Graveyard, the Battle Damage you took from this battle is also inflicted to your opponent.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1362, N'EEN', 96300057, N'EEN-EN011', N'W-Wing Catapult', N'Union Monster', 1300, 1500, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'Once per turn, you can either: Target 1 "V-Tiger Jet" you control; equip this card to that target, OR: Unequip this card and Special Summon it. If the equipped monster would be destroyed by battle or card effect, destroy this card instead. The equipped monster gains 400 ATK/DEF.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1363, N'EEN', 23309606, N'EEN-EN012', N'Infernal Incinerator', N'Effect Monster', 2800, 1800, 6, N'FIRE', N'Fiend', N'This card can only be Normal Summoned or Set by discarding all other card(s) in your hand and Tributing 1 card you control with 2000 or more ATK. This card gains 200 ATK for each monster your opponent controls. This card loses 500 ATK for each other monster you control.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1364, N'EEN', 22587018, N'EEN-EN013', N'Hydrogeddon', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1000, 4, N'WATER', N'Dinosaur', N'When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the GY: You can Special Summon 1 "Hydrogeddon" from your Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1365, N'EEN', 58071123, N'EEN-EN014', N'Oxygeddon', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 800, 4, N'WIND', N'Dinosaur', N'If this card is destroyed by battle with a Pyro monster and sent to the GY: Each player takes 800 damage.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1366, N'EEN', 85066822, N'EEN-EN015', N'Water Dragon', N'Effect Monster', 2800, 2600, 8, N'WATER', N'Sea Serpent', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned with "Bonding - H2O". The ATK of FIRE monsters and Pyro monsters on the field becomes 0. When this card is destroyed and sent to the GY: You can target 2 "Hydrogeddon" and 1 "Oxygeddon" in your GY; Special Summon them.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1367, N'EEN', 11460577, N'EEN-EN016', N'Etoile Cyber', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 1600, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'If this card attacks directly, it gains 500 ATK during the Damage Step only.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1368, N'EEN', 44954628, N'EEN-EN017', N'B.E.S. Tetran', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 2300, 6, N'WIND', N'Machine', N'When this card is Normal Summoned, put 3 counters on it. This card cannot be destroyed by battle. If this card attacks or is attacked, remove 1 counter from this card at the end of the Damage Step. If you cannot, destroy it. Once per turn, you can remove 1 counter on this card to destroy 1 Spell or Trap Card on the field.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1369, N'EEN', 70948327, N'EEN-EN018', N'Nanobreaker', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1800, 4, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'If this card attacks a face-up Level 3 or lower monster, destroy the monster immediately with this card''s effect without applying damage calculation.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1370, N'EEN', 6337436, N'EEN-EN019', N'Rapid-Fire Magician', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1200, 4, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'Inflict 400 damage to your opponent each time you activate a Normal Spell Card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1371, N'EEN', 33731070, N'EEN-EN020', N'Beiige, Vanguard of Dark World', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1300, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If this card is discarded to the GY by card effect: Special Summon this card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1372, N'EEN', 79126789, N'EEN-EN021', N'Broww, Huntsman of Dark World', N'Effect Monster', 1400, 800, 3, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If this card is discarded to the GY by card effect: Draw 1 card, or, if it was discarded from your hand to your GY by an opponent''s card effect, draw 2 cards instead.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1373, N'EEN', 6214884, N'EEN-EN022', N'Brron, Mad King of Dark World', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 400, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'When this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: You can discard 1 card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1374, N'EEN', 32619583, N'EEN-EN023', N'Sillva, Warlord of Dark World', N'Effect Monster', 2300, 1400, 5, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If this card is discarded to the GY by card effect: Special Summon this card, then, if it was discarded from your hand to your GY by an opponent''s card effect, your opponent places exactly 2 cards from their hand on the bottom of their Deck, in any order.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1375, N'EEN', 78004197, N'EEN-EN024', N'Goldd, Wu-Lord of Dark World', N'Effect Monster', 2300, 1400, 5, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If this card is discarded to the GY by card effect: If it was discarded from your hand to your GY by an opponent''s card effect, you can target up to 2 cards your opponent controls; Special Summon this card, then destroy those targets (if any).', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1376, N'EEN', 5498296, N'EEN-EN025', N'Scarr, Scout of Dark World', N'Effect Monster', 500, 500, 2, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: Add 1 Level 4 or lower "Dark World" monster from your Deck to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1377, N'EEN', 31887905, N'EEN-EN026', N'Familiar-Possessed - Aussa', N'Effect Monster', 1850, 1500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand or Deck) by sending 1 face-up "Aussa the Earth Charmer" and 1 face-up EARTH monster from your Monster Zone to the GY. If this card Special Summoned by its own effect attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage.

