    (1378, N'EEN', 68881649, N'EEN-EN027', N'Familiar-Possessed - Eria', N'Effect Monster', 1850, 1500, 4, N'WATER', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand or Deck) by sending 1 face-up "Eria the Water Charmer" and 1 face-up WATER monster from your Monster Zone to the GY. If this card Special Summoned by its own effect attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage.

* The above text is unofficial and describes the card''s functionality in the OCG.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1379, N'EEN', 4376658, N'EEN-EN028', N'Familiar-Possessed - Hiita', N'Effect Monster', 1850, 1500, 4, N'FIRE', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand or Deck) by sending 1 face-up "Hiita the Fire Charmer" and 1 face-up FIRE monster from your Monster Zone to the GY. If this card Special Summoned by its own effect attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage.

* The above text is unofficial and describes the card''s functionality in the OCG.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1380, N'EEN', 31764353, N'EEN-EN029', N'Familiar-Possessed - Wynn', N'Effect Monster', 1850, 1500, 4, N'WIND', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand or Deck) by sending 1 face-up "Wynn the Wind Charmer" and 1 face-up WIND monster from your Monster Zone to the GY. If this card Special Summoned by its own effect attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage.

* The above text is unofficial and describes the card''s functionality in the OCG.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1381, N'EEN', 58859575, N'EEN-EN030', N'VW-Tiger Catapult', N'Fusion Monster', 2000, 2100, 6, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'"V-Tiger Jet" + "W-Wing Catapult"
Must first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by banishing the above cards you control. You can discard 1 card, then target 1 monster your opponent controls; change that target''s battle position. (Flip effects are not activated.)', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1382, N'EEN', 84243274, N'EEN-EN031', N'VWXYZ-Dragon Catapult Cannon', N'Fusion Monster', 3000, 2800, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'"VW-Tiger Catapult" + "XYZ-Dragon Cannon"
Must first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by banishing the above cards you control. Once per turn: You can target 1 card your opponent controls; banish that target. When this card declares an attack on an opponent''s monster: You can target the attack target; change that attack target''s battle position. (Flip effects are not activated.)', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1383, N'EEN', 10248389, N'EEN-EN032', N'Cyber Blader', N'Fusion Monster', 2100, 800, 7, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'"Etoile Cyber" + "Blade Skater"
A Fusion Summon of this card can only be done with the above Fusion Materials. This card gains the following effect, based on the number of monsters your opponent controls.
● 1: Cannot be destroyed by battle.
● 2: This card''s ATK is doubled.
● 3: Your opponent''s activated card effects are negated.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1384, N'EEN', 47737087, N'EEN-EN033', N'Elemental HERO Rampart Blaster', N'Fusion Monster', 2000, 2500, 6, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Clayman" + "Elemental HERO Burstinatrix"
Must be Fusion Summoned. This card can attack directly while in Defense Position. If it does, apply its ATK for damage calculation, and its ATK is halved during damage calculation only.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1385, N'EEN', 83121692, N'EEN-EN034', N'Elemental HERO Tempest', N'Fusion Monster', 2800, 2800, 8, N'WIND', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Avian" + "Elemental HERO Sparkman" + "Elemental HERO Bubbleman"
Must be Fusion Summoned. You can send 1 other card you control to the GY, then target 1 monster you control; while this card is face-up on the field, that monster cannot be destroyed by battle.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1386, N'EEN', 10526791, N'EEN-EN035', N'Elemental HERO Wildedge', N'Fusion Monster', 2600, 2300, 8, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Wildheart" + "Elemental HERO Bladedge"
Must be Fusion Summoned and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. This card can attack every monster your opponent controls (one attack on each monster per Battle Phase).', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1387, N'EEN', 25366484, N'EEN-EN036', N'Elemental HERO Shining Flare Wingman', N'Fusion Monster', 2500, 2100, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Flame Wingman" + "Elemental HERO Sparkman"
Must be Fusion Summoned. Gains 300 ATK for each "Elemental HERO" card in your GY. If this card destroys a monster by battle and sends it to the GY: Inflict damage to your opponent equal to that monster''s original ATK in the GY.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1388, N'EEN', 67169062, N'EEN-EN037', N'Pot of Avarice', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Target 5 monsters in your GY; shuffle all 5 into the Deck, then draw 2 cards.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1389, N'EEN', 93554166, N'EEN-EN038', N'Dark World Lightning', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Target 1 Set card on the field; destroy that target, then discard 1 card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1390, N'EEN', 61850482, N'EEN-EN039', N'Level Modulation', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Your opponent draws 2 cards. Special Summon 1 "LV" monster from your Graveyard, ignoring the Summoning conditions. The monster that was Special Summoned by this effect cannot attack, nor activate or apply its effect this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1391, N'EEN', 24643836, N'EEN-EN040', N'Ojamagic', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'If this card is sent from the hand or field to the GY: Add 1 each of "Ojama Green", "Ojama Yellow", and "Ojama Black" from your Deck to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1392, N'EEN', 98259197, N'EEN-EN041', N'Ojamuscle', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'(This card is always treated as a "Ojama" card.)
Select 1 face-up "Ojama King". Destroy all "Ojama" monsters on the field, except the selected "Ojama King". It gains 1000 ATK for each monster destroyed this way.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1393, N'EEN', 19394153, N'EEN-EN042', N'Feather Shot', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Target 1 face-up "Elemental HERO Avian" you control; during this turn, that target can attack a number of times equal to the number of monsters you control when this card resolves, but cannot attack directly, and other monsters you control cannot attack this turn.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1394, N'EEN', 45898858, N'EEN-EN043', N'Bonding - H2O', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Tribute 2 "Hydrogeddon" and 1 "Oxygeddon"; Special Summon 1 "Water Dragon" from your hand, Deck, or GY.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1395, N'EEN', 46910446, N'EEN-EN044', N'Chthonian Alliance', N'Equip Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'The equipped monster gains 800 ATK for each other face-up monster on the field that has the same name it does.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1396, N'EEN', 90374791, N'EEN-EN045', N'Armed Changer', N'Equip Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Send 1 Equip Spell Card from your hand to the Graveyard to activate this card. If the equipped monster destroys a monster by battle, the controller of this Equip Card can add 1 monster with ATK equal to or less than the equipped monster from their Graveyard to their hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1397, N'EEN', 30548775, N'EEN-EN046', N'Branch!', N'Continuous Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'When a Fusion Monster(s) on the field is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can target 1 of the Fusion Materials in your Graveyard that was used for its Fusion Summon; Special Summon it.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1398, N'EEN', 66947414, N'EEN-EN047', N'Boss Rush', N'Continuous Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'You cannot activate this card if you Normal Summoned/Set this turn. While this card is face-up on the field, you cannot Normal Summon/Set. During the End Phase, if a face-up "B.E.S." monster you control was destroyed and sent to the GY this turn: You can Special Summon 1 "B.E.S." monster from your Deck.

* The above text is unofficial and describes the card''s functionality in the OCG.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1399, N'EEN', 93431518, N'EEN-EN048', N'Gateway to Dark World', N'Quick-Play Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Target 1 "Dark World" monster in your GY; Special Summon that target. You cannot Summon monsters the turn you activate this card, except by this effect (but you can Normal Set).', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
    (1400, N'EEN', 44676200, N'EEN-EN049', N'Hero Barrier', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'During your opponent''s turn: negate the next attack this turn from a monster your opponent controls while you control an "Elemental HERO" monster.

* The above text is unofficial and describes the card''s functionality in the OCG.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11');
