    (1458, N'SOI', 92001300, N'SOI-EN047', N'Ancient Gear Castle', N'Continuous Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'All "Ancient Gear" monsters gain 300 ATK. Each time a monster is Normal Summoned/Set, place 1 counter on this card. If you Tribute Summon an "Ancient Gear" monster face-up, you can Tribute this card instead, if the number of its counters is equal to or greater than the number of required Tribute(s).', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
