    (1460, N'SOI', 29590905, N'SOI-EN049', N'Super Junior Confrontation', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only when an opponent''s monster declares an attack. Negate the battle, and 1 monster with the lowest ATK in face-up Attack Position your opponent controls battles against 1 monster with the lowest DEF in face-up Defense Position you control. After that battle, end the Battle Phase.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:11'),
