    (1609, N'CDIP', 84478195, N'CDIP-EN018', N'Barrier Statue of the Abyss', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'Neither player can Special Summon monsters, except DARK monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1610, N'CDIP', 10963799, N'CDIP-EN019', N'Barrier Statue of the Torrent', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'WATER', N'Aqua', N'Neither player can Special Summon monsters, except WATER monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1611, N'CDIP', 47961808, N'CDIP-EN020', N'Barrier Statue of the Inferno', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'FIRE', N'Pyro', N'Neither player can Special Summon monsters, except FIRE monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1612, N'CDIP', 73356503, N'CDIP-EN021', N'Barrier Statue of the Stormwinds', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'WIND', N'Winged Beast', N'Neither player can Special Summon monsters, except WIND monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1613, N'CDIP', 19740112, N'CDIP-EN022', N'Barrier Statue of the Drought', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'Neither player can Special Summon monsters, except EARTH monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1614, N'CDIP', 46145256, N'CDIP-EN023', N'Barrier Statue of the Heavens', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Fairy', N'Neither player can Special Summon monsters, except LIGHT monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1615, N'CDIP', 72634965, N'CDIP-EN024', N'Vanity''s Ruler', N'Effect Monster', 2500, 1600, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Fairy', N'Cannot be Special Summoned. Your opponent cannot Special Summon monsters.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1616, N'CDIP', 9628664, N'CDIP-EN025', N'Iris, the Earth Mother', N'Effect Monster', 2400, 1200, 6, N'LIGHT', N'Fairy', N'After a Chain with 3 or more Links resolves, draw 1 card. This effect cannot activate if multiple cards/effects with the same name were activated in that Chain.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1617, N'CDIP', 45023678, N'CDIP-EN026', N'Lightning Punisher', N'Effect Monster', 2600, 1600, 7, N'DARK', N'Thunder', N'After a Chain with 3 or more Links resolves, destroy 1 card on your opponent''s side of the field. This effect cannot activate if multiple cards/effects with the same name were activated in that Chain.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1618, N'CDIP', 71411377, N'CDIP-EN027', N'Queen''s Bodyguard', N'Effect Monster', 1700, 1200, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'"Allure Queen" monsters on your side of the field cannot be selected as an attack target.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1619, N'CDIP', 8806072, N'CDIP-EN028', N'Combo Fighter', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 800, 4, N'WIND', N'Warrior', N'If a Chain (of 2 or more Links) occurred in your Main Phase 1, this card can attack twice during the Battle Phase this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1620, N'CDIP', 44800181, N'CDIP-EN029', N'Combo Master', N'Effect Monster', 2200, 1500, 5, N'WIND', N'Warrior', N'If a Chain (of 2 or more Links) occurred in your Main Phase 1, this card can attack twice during the Battle Phase this turn.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1621, N'CDIP', 71395725, N'CDIP-EN030', N'Man Beast of Ares', N'Effect Monster', 500, 500, 3, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'After a Chain (of 2 or more Links) resolves, this card gains 500 ATK.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1622, N'CDIP', 3784434, N'CDIP-EN031', N'Rampaging Rhynos', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1500, 3, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'Once per turn, this card can move to an adjacent (horizontal) unoccupied Monster Card Zone. If this card attacks the monster in its same column, this card gains 500 ATK during the Damage Step.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1623, N'CDIP', 39188539, N'CDIP-EN032', N'Storm Shooter', N'Effect Monster', 2300, 500, 7, N'WIND', N'Winged Beast', N'Once per turn, you can select and activate 1 of these effects:
● Move this card to an adjacent (horizontal) unoccupied Monster Card Zone.
● Return 1 Spell, Trap or Monster Card on your opponent''s side of the field in the same column as this card to its owner''s hand.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1624, N'CDIP', 76573247, N'CDIP-EN033', N'Alien Infiltrator', N'Effect Monster', 800, 500, 2, N'EARTH', N'Reptile', N'Once per turn, this card can move to an adjacent (horizontal) unoccupied Monster Card Zone. If no Spell, Trap or Monster Card on your opponent''s side of the field is in the same column as this card, it can attack your opponent directly.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1625, N'CDIP', 99532708, N'CDIP-EN034', N'Alien Mars', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 3, N'FIRE', N'Reptile', N'The effects of Effect Monsters with A-Counters are negated, except for "Alien Mars".', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1626, N'CDIP', 40418351, N'CDIP-EN035', N'Cyberdark Dragon', N'Fusion Monster', 1000, 1000, 8, N'DARK', N'Machine', N'"Cyberdark Horn" + "Cyberdark Edge" + "Cyberdark Keel"
Must be Fusion Summoned. If this card is Special Summoned: Target 1 Dragon monster in your GY; equip that target to this card. Gains ATK equal to the original ATK of the monster equipped to it by this effect. Gains 100 ATK for each monster in your GY. If this card would be destroyed by battle, destroy that equipped monster instead.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1627, N'CDIP', 37057012, N'CDIP-EN036', N'Cyber Ogre 2', N'Fusion Monster', 2600, 1900, 7, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'"Cyber Ogre" + "Cyber Ogre"
A Fusion Summon of this monster can only be conducted with the above Fusion Material Monsters. When this card attacks, it gains ATK equal to half the ATK of the attack target, during damage calculation only.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1628, N'CDIP', 2561846, N'CDIP-EN037', N'Corruption Cell "A"', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Place 1 A-Counter on 1 face-up monster on your opponent''s side of the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1629, N'CDIP', 39956951, N'CDIP-EN038', N'Flash of the Forbidden Spell', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'If your opponent controls monsters in all of their Main Monster Zones: Destroy all monsters your opponent controls.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1630, N'CDIP', 65450690, N'CDIP-EN039', N'Ritual Foregone', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Pay 1000 LP; Special Summon 1 Ritual Monster from your hand, but it cannot attack, also destroy it during the End Phase. You can only activate 1 "Ritual Foregone" per turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1631, N'CDIP', 1845204, N'CDIP-EN040', N'Instant Fusion', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Pay 1000 LP; Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, but it cannot attack, also it is destroyed during the End Phase. (This is treated as a Fusion Summon.) You can only activate 1 "Instant Fusion" per turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1632, N'CDIP', 38834303, N'CDIP-EN041', N'Counter Cleaner', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Pay 500 LP; remove all counters on the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1633, N'CDIP', 64238008, N'CDIP-EN042', N'Linear Accelerator Cannon', N'Normal Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Tribute 1 monster and inflict damage to your opponent equal to half that monster''s original ATK. If you activate this card, you cannot activate any other Spell Cards this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:12'),
    (1634, N'CDIP', 91623717, N'CDIP-EN043', N'Chain Strike', N'Quick-Play Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only as Chain Link 2 or higher; inflict 400 damage to your opponent times the Chain Link number of this card. You cannot activate this card if multiple cards/effects with the same name are in that Chain.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1635, N'CDIP', 37011715, N'CDIP-EN044', N'Miraculous Rebirth', N'Quick-Play Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only as Chain Link 4 or higher. Select 1 monster from either player''s Graveyard and Special Summon it. You cannot activate this card if multiple cards/effects with the same name are in that Chain.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1636, N'CDIP', 63516460, N'CDIP-EN045', N'Mystical Wind Typhoon', N'Quick-Play Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only as Chain Link 3 or higher. Destroy 1 Spell or Trap Card on the field. You cannot activate this card if multiple cards/effects with the same name are in that Chain.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1637, N'CDIP', 90500169, N'CDIP-EN046', N'Level Down!?', N'Quick-Play Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Select 1 face-up "LV" monster on the field to activate this card. Return the selected card to its owner''s Deck and Special Summon 1 monster from the owner''s Graveyard to their side of the field with the same name but lower "LV" (ignoring the Summoning conditions).', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1638, N'CDIP', 36995273, N'CDIP-EN047', N'Degenerate Circuit', N'Continuous Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'The controller of this card pays 500 Life Points during each of their Standby Phases (this is not optional). Monster Cards that would be returned from the field to the hand are removed from play instead.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1639, N'CDIP', 63394872, N'CDIP-EN048', N'Senet Switch', N'Continuous Spell Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Once per turn: You can target 1 monster in your Main Monster Zone and choose 1 of its unused adjacent (horizontal) Monster Zones; move that target to the chosen adjacent zone.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1640, N'CDIP', 99788587, N'CDIP-EN049', N'Blasting Fuse', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only when all zones of this card''s column are occupied. Destroy all cards in this column.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1641, N'CDIP', 25173686, N'CDIP-EN050', N'Straight Flush', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'If your opponent controls a card in each of their Spell & Trap Zones: Destroy all cards in their Spell & Trap Zones.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1642, N'CDIP', 62271284, N'CDIP-EN051', N'Justi-Break', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'When your opponent''s monster declares an attack on your Normal Monster: Destroy all monsters on the field, except Attack Position Normal Monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1643, N'CDIP', 98666339, N'CDIP-EN052', N'Dimensional Inversion', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only when a monster(s) you own is removed from play by an opponent''s effect. Special Summon 1 of those monsters.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1644, N'CDIP', 25050038, N'CDIP-EN053', N'Chain Healing', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Gain 500 Life Points. If this card was activated as Chain Link 2 or 3, add this card to the Deck and shuffle it. If this card was activated as Chain Link 4 or higher, return this card to the hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1645, N'CDIP', 51449743, N'CDIP-EN054', N'Chain Detonation', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Inflict 500 damage to your opponent. If this card was activated as Chain Link 2 or 3, add this card to the Deck and shuffle it. If this card was activated as Chain Link 4 or higher, return this card to the hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1646, N'CDIP', 36935434, N'CDIP-EN055', N'Byroad Sacrifice', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only if a monster on your side of the field is destroyed by battle. Special Summon 1 "Cyber Ogre" from your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1647, N'CDIP', 63323539, N'CDIP-EN056', N'Trojan Blast', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only when an opponent''s card effect shifts control of a monster from your side of the field to theirs. Destroy that 1 monster and inflict damage to your opponent equal to its ATK.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1648, N'CDIP', 98444741, N'CDIP-EN057', N'Accumulated Fortune', N'Normal Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only as Chain Link 4 or higher. Draw 2 cards. You cannot activate this card if multiple cards/effects with the same name are in that Chain.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1649, N'CDIP', 90440725, N'CDIP-EN058', N'Cyber Shadow Gardna', N'Continuous Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'During your opponent''s Main Phase: Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Machine/EARTH/Level 4/ATK ?/DEF ?). (This card is also still a Trap.) When an opponent''s monster declares an attack that targets this card: The ATK/DEF of this card become the ATK/DEF of the attacking monster. Once per turn, during your opponent''s End Phase: Set this card in its Spell & Trap Zone.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1650, N'CDIP', 24838456, N'CDIP-EN059', N'Vanity''s Call', N'Counter Trap Card', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Activate only as Chain Link 4 or higher. Pay half your Life Points. Negate the activation and effects of all other cards in the same Chain, and destroy them.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
