    (1775, N'TAEV', 60606759, N'TAEV', N'Renge, Gatekeeper of Dark World', N'Normal', 100, 2100, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'His renowned athletic physique has made him famous with the populace of Dark World. They call him "Iron Wall Renge" because no one can break through his incredible defenses.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1776, N'TAEV', 96005454, N'TAEV', N'Hunter Dragon', N'Normal', 1700, 100, 3, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'This dragon has taken down countless prey with its sharp fangs. It strikes very quickly, because if it does not strike first it is vulnerable to a counter-attack.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1777, N'TAEV', 22499463, N'TAEV', N'Venom Cobra', N'Normal', 100, 2000, 4, N'EARTH', N'Reptile', N'Hard scales cover all parts of this gigantic cobra. It hunts by shooting out massive amounts of venom, but because of its large size, its attack pattern is easily predicted.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1778, N'TAEV', 79856792, N'TAEV', N'Rainbow Dragon', N'Effect', 4000, 0, 10, N'LIGHT', N'Dragon', N'(This card is always treated as an "Ultimate Crystal" card.)
Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by having 7 "Crystal Beast" cards with different names on your field and/or GY. This card cannot activate the following effects the turn it is Special Summoned. (Quick Effect): You can send all face-up "Crystal Beast" monsters you control to the GY; this card gains 1000 ATK for each monster sent to the GY. You can banish all "Crystal Beast" monsters from your GY; shuffle all cards on the field into the Deck.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1779, N'TAEV', 43751755, N'TAEV', N'Chrysalis Pantail', N'Effect', 800, 300, 2, N'DARK', N'Beast', N'You can Tribute this card while "Neo Space" is on the field to Special Summon 1 "Neo-Spacian Dark Panther" from your hand or Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1780, N'TAEV', 17363041, N'TAEV', N'Chrysalis Chicky', N'Effect', 600, 400, 2, N'WIND', N'Winged Beast', N'You can Tribute this card while "Neo Space" is on the field to Special Summon 1 "Neo-Spacian Air Hummingbird" from your hand or Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1781, N'TAEV', 29246354, N'TAEV', N'Chrysalis Pinny', N'Effect', 100, 700, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Plant', N'You can Tribute this card while "Neo Space" is on the field to Special Summon 1 "Neo-Spacian Glow Moss" from your hand or Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1782, N'TAEV', 16241441, N'TAEV', N'Chrysalis Larva', N'Effect', 300, 300, 2, N'FIRE', N'Insect', N'You can Tribute this card while "Neo Space" is on the field to Special Summon 1 "Neo-Spacian Flare Scarab" from your hand or Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1783, N'TAEV', 42239546, N'TAEV', N'Chrysalis Mole', N'Effect', 700, 100, 2, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'You can Tribute this card while "Neo Space" is on the field to Special Summon 1 "Neo-Spacian Grand Mole" from your hand or Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1784, N'TAEV', 4906301, N'TAEV', N'Necro Gardna', N'Effect', 600, 1300, 3, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'During your opponent''s turn: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; negate the next attack this turn from a monster your opponent controls (this is a Quick Effect).', N'ULTIMATE RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1785, N'TAEV', 8062132, N'TAEV', N'Vennominaga the Deity of Poisonous Snakes', N'Effect', 0, 0, 10, N'DARK', N'Reptile', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. Must first be Special Summoned with "Rise of the Snake Deity" and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways except by its own effect. This card gains 500 ATK for each Reptile-Type monster in your Graveyard. This card cannot be targeted by, and is unaffected by, Spell/Trap effects and other Effect Monsters'' effects. When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish 1 other Reptile-Type monster from your Graveyard; Special Summon this card. When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent: Place 1 Hyper-Venom Counter on it. When 3 Hyper-Venom Counters are on this card, you win the Duel.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1786, N'TAEV', 72677437, N'TAEV', N'Vennominon the King of Poisonous Snakes', N'Effect', 0, 0, 8, N'DARK', N'Reptile', N'Cannot be Special Summoned by another Effect Monster''s effect. This card is unaffected by "Venom Swamp". This card gains 500 ATK for each Reptile-Type monster in your Graveyard. When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish 1 other Reptile-Type monster from your Graveyard; Special Summon this card.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1787, N'TAEV', 73899015, N'TAEV', N'Venom Snake', N'Effect', 1200, 600, 3, N'EARTH', N'Reptile', N'Once per turn, you can place 1 Venom Counter on 1 monster your opponent controls. If you activate this effect, this card cannot attack during this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1788, N'TAEV', 9284723, N'TAEV', N'Venom Boa', N'Effect', 1600, 1200, 5, N'EARTH', N'Reptile', N'Once per turn, you can place 2 Venom Counters on 1 monster your opponent controls. If you activate this effect, this card cannot attack during this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1789, N'TAEV', 36278828, N'TAEV', N'Venom Serpent', N'Effect', 1000, 800, 4, N'DARK', N'Reptile', N'Once per turn, you can place 1 Venom Counter on 1 monster your opponent controls.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1790, N'TAEV', 69884162, N'TAEV', N'Elemental HERO Neos Alius', N'Monster', 1900, 1300, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the GY. While this card is a Normal Monster on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it become an Effect Monster with this effect.
