    (1791, N'TAEV', 95888876, N'TAEV', N'Chthonian Emperor Dragon', N'Monster', 2400, 1500, 6, N'FIRE', N'Dragon', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● This card can attack twice during the same Battle Phase.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1792, N'TAEV', 22377815, N'TAEV', N'Aquarian Alessa', N'Monster', 1500, 500, 4, N'WATER', N'Aqua', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard, they discard 1 random card.', N'ULTIMATE RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1793, N'TAEV', 68762510, N'TAEV', N'Lucky Pied Piper', N'Monster', 1500, 500, 4, N'WIND', N'Fairy', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard, draw 1 card.', N'ULTIMATE RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1794, N'TAEV', 95166228, N'TAEV', N'Grasschopper', N'Monster', 2350, 1000, 5, N'EARTH', N'Insect', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● This card can attack all monsters your opponent controls once each.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1795, N'TAEV', 21155323, N'TAEV', N'Goggle Golem', N'Monster', 1500, 500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● The original ATK of this card becomes 2100.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1796, N'TAEV', 57549932, N'TAEV', N'Dawnbreak Gardna', N'Monster', 1500, 500, 3, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● The original DEF of this card becomes 2300.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1797, N'TAEV', 94944637, N'TAEV', N'Doom Shaman', N'Monster', 2400, 2000, 6, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is a Normal Monster on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it become an Effect Monster with this effect.
● Once per turn: You can Special Summon 1 Fiend-Type monster from your hand or from either Graveyard. When this card leaves the field, destroy all Fiend-Type monsters Special Summoned by this effect.', N'ULTIMATE RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1798, N'TAEV', 20438745, N'TAEV', N'King Pyron', N'Monster', 1500, 500, 5, N'FIRE', N'Pyro', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● Once per turn, you can inflict 1000 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1799, N'TAEV', 57827484, N'TAEV', N'Shadow Delver', N'Monster', 1500, 500, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● Once per turn, you can select 1 face-up Level 4 or lower DARK monster you control. It can attack your opponent directly this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1800, N'TAEV', 83812099, N'TAEV', N'Flint Lock', N'Effect', 1500, 800, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'Once per turn: You can target 1 "Flint" in the Spell & Trap Zone; equip it to this card. During your Main Phase: You can target 1 "Flint" equipped to this card, and 1 face-up monster on the field, except this card; equip that "Flint" to that targeted monster. This card can only be equipped with 1 "Flint". While equipped with "Flint", this card is unaffected by the effect of "Flint", and cannot be destroyed by battle.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13');
