    (1803, N'TAEV', 82099401, N'TAEV', N'Crystal Seer', N'Effect', 100, 100, 1, N'WATER', N'Spellcaster', N'FLIP: Excavate the top 2 cards of your Deck, then add 1 of them to your hand, then place the other on the bottom of your Deck.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
