    (1805, N'TAEV', 55589254, N'TAEV', N'Frost and Flame Dragon', N'Effect', 2300, 2000, 6, N'WATER', N'Dragon', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 1 FIRE and 2 WATER monsters from your Graveyard, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. Once per turn: You can discard 1 card to target 1 monster on the field; destroy that target.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1806, N'TAEV', 81977953, N'TAEV', N'Desert Twister', N'Effect', 2300, 2000, 6, N'WIND', N'Fiend', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 2 WIND and 1 EARTH monsters from your GY. Once per turn: You can discard 1 card, then target 1 Spell/Trap on the field; destroy it.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1807, N'TAEV', 34334692, N'TAEV', N'Ritual Raven', N'Effect', 300, 300, 1, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If you Ritual Summon a DARK Ritual Monster, this 1 card can be used as the entire Tribute.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1808, N'TAEV', 18372968, N'TAEV', N'Razor Lizard', N'Effect', 1500, 300, 3, N'EARTH', N'Reptile', N'While you control another Reptile-Type monster, if this card attacks a face-down Defense Position monster, destroy the monster immediately with this card''s effect without flipping it face-up or applying damage calculation.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1809, N'TAEV', 54766667, N'TAEV', N'Light Effigy', N'Effect', 1500, 0, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Fairy', N'If you Tribute Summon a LIGHT Normal Monster, you can treat this 1 monster as 2 Tributes.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1810, N'TAEV', 81755371, N'TAEV', N'Dark Effigy', N'Effect', 1500, 0, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If you Tribute Summon a DARK Normal Monster, you can treat this 1 monster as 2 Tributes.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1811, N'TAEV', 17259470, N'TAEV', N'Zombie Master', N'Effect', 1800, 0, 4, N'DARK', N'Zombie', N'Once per turn: You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY, then target 1 Level 4 or lower Zombie monster in either GY; Special Summon that target. This monster must be face-up on the field to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'ULTIMATE RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1812, N'TAEV', 78734254, N'TAEV', N'Neo-Spacian Marine Dolphin', N'Fusion', 900, 1100, 4, N'WATER', N'Warrior', N'This card''s name is also treated as "Neo-Spacian Aqua Dolphin". This card cannot be Special Summoned except with "NEX". Once per turn, you can discard 1 card to look at your opponent''s hand and select 1 Monster Card in it. If you control a monster with ATK greater than or equal to the selected monster''s, destroy the selected monster and inflict 500 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1813, N'TAEV', 5128859, N'TAEV', N'Elemental HERO Marine Neos', N'Fusion', 2800, 2300, 8, N'WATER', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Neos" + "Neo-Spacian Marine Dolphin"
Must first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by shuffling the above cards you control into the Deck. (You do not use "Polymerization".) Once per turn: You can destroy 1 random card in your opponent''s hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1814, N'TAEV', 41517968, N'TAEV', N'Elemental HERO Darkbright', N'Fusion', 2000, 1000, 6, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Sparkman" + "Elemental HERO Necroshade"
Must be Fusion Summoned and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing Battle Damage to your opponent. If this card attacks, change it to Defense Position at the end of the Damage Step. If this card is destroyed: Target 1 monster your opponent controls; destroy that target.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1815, N'TAEV', 78512663, N'TAEV', N'Elemental HERO Magma Neos', N'Fusion', 3000, 2500, 9, N'FIRE', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Neos" + "Neo-Spacian Flare Scarab" + "Neo-Spacian Grand Mole"
Must first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by shuffling the above cards you control into the Deck. (You do not use "Polymerization".) This card gains 400 ATK for each card on the field. Once per turn, during the End Phase: Shuffle this card into the Extra Deck. If this card is shuffled into the Extra Deck this way: Return all cards on the field to the hand.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1816, N'TAEV', 40391316, N'TAEV', N'Ojama Knight', N'Fusion', 0, 2500, 5, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'1 "Ojama" monster + 1 "Ojama" monster
Select up to 2 of your opponent''s Monster Card Zones. The selected zones cannot be used.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1817, N'TAEV', 55428811, N'TAEV', N'Fifth Hope', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Target 5 "Elemental HERO" cards in your Graveyard; shuffle them into the Deck, then draw 2 cards (draw 3 cards instead, if you had no other cards on your side of the field and in your hand when you activated this card).', N'ULTIMATE RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1818, N'TAEV', 18302224, N'TAEV', N'Reverse of Neos', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Quick-Play', N'Activate only when a face-up "Neos" Fusion Monster you control is destroyed. Special Summon 1 "Elemental Hero Neos" from your Deck in Attack Position. It gains 1000 ATK and is destroyed during the End Phase of this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1819, N'TAEV', 82639107, N'TAEV', N'Convert Contact', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'If you control no monsters: Send 2 "Neo-Spacian" monsters (1 from your hand and 1 from your Deck) to the GY, then draw 2 cards.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1820, N'TAEV', 80368942, N'TAEV', N'Cocoon Party', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Special Summon 1 "Chrysalis" monster from your Deck for each "Neo-Spacian" monster with a different name in your Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1821, N'TAEV', 81913510, N'TAEV', N'NEX', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Send 1 face-up "Neo-Spacian" monster you control to the Graveyard. Special Summon 1 Level 4 monster with the same name from your Extra Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1822, N'TAEV', 43644025, N'TAEV', N'Cocoon Rebirth', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Continuous', N'You can Tribute 1 face-up "Chrysalis" monster you control to Special Summon 1 "Neo-Spacian" monster written in the card text of that card from either player''s Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1823, N'TAEV', 54306223, N'TAEV', N'Venom Swamp', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Field', N'During each player''s End Phase: Place 1 Venom Counter on each face-up monster, except "Venom" monsters. Monsters lose 500 ATK for each Venom Counter on them. Destroy a monster if its ATK becomes 0 by this effect.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1824, N'TAEV', 17189677, N'TAEV', N'Snake Rain', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Discard 1 card. Select 4 Reptile-Type monsters from your Deck and send them to the Graveyard.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1825, N'TAEV', 60728397, N'TAEV', N'Venom Shot', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Activate only while you control a face-up "Venom" monster, "Vennominaga the Deity of Poisonous Snakes", or "Vennominon the King of Poisonous Snakes". Send 1 Reptile-Type monster from your Deck to the Graveyard and place 2 Venom Counters on 1 face-up monster your opponent controls.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1826, N'TAEV', 80033124, N'TAEV', N'Cyberdark Impact!', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Fusion Summon 1 "Cyberdark Dragon" from your Extra Deck, by returning 1 each of "Cyberdark Horn", "Cyberdark Edge", and "Cyberdark Keel" from your hand, GY, and/or anywhere on your field, to the Deck, as Fusion Material.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1827, N'TAEV', 16437822, N'TAEV', N'Flint Missile', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Quick-Play', N'Destroy 1 monster equipped with "Flint". You can return this card to your Deck instead of sending it to the Graveyard after it resolves.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1828, N'TAEV', 43422537, N'TAEV', N'Double Summon', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'You can conduct 2 Normal Summons/Sets this turn, not just 1.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1829, N'TAEV', 79816536, N'TAEV', N'Summoner''s Art', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Add 1 Level 5 or higher Normal Monster from your Deck to your hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1830, N'TAEV', 15305240, N'TAEV', N'Creature Seizure', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Each player gives their opponent control of 1 of their monsters (controller''s choice). You must choose a face-up Normal Monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1831, N'TAEV', 42709949, N'TAEV', N'Phalanx Pike', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Equip', N'The equipped monster gains 900 ATK for each card in either Graveyard that has the same name it does.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1832, N'TAEV', 78794994, N'TAEV', N'Symbols of Duty', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Equip', N'Send 1 Normal Monster you control to the Graveyard, then target 1 monster in either player''s Graveyard; Special Summon it, and if you do, equip this card to it. When this card leaves the field, destroy the equipped monster.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1833, N'TAEV', 5183693, N'TAEV', N'Amulet of Ambition', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Equip', N'Equip only to a Normal Monster. If it battles a monster with a higher Level, the equipped monster gains 500 ATK x the difference in Levels, during that damage calculation only. When this card is sent to the GY: You can place it on top of your Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
