    (1955, N'GLAS', 42534368, N'GLAS', N'Silent Doom', N'Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Target 1 Normal Monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it in face-up Defense Position, but it cannot attack.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1956, N'PTDN', 14536035, N'PTDN', N'Dark Grepher', N'Effect', 1700, 1600, 4, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by discarding 1 Level 5 or higher DARK monster. Once per turn: You can discard 1 DARK monster; send 1 DARK monster from your Deck to the GY.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1957, N'PTDN', 90582719, N'PTDN', N'Gladiator Beast Andal', N'Normal', 1900, 1500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'This one-eyed warrior bear is an aggressive hunter that strikes down its prey with the powerful swipes of its claws. No one can bear the brunt of his tremendously fast and heavy blows.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1958, N'PTDN', 26976414, N'PTDN', N'Atlantean Pikeman', N'Normal', 1400, 0, 2, N'WATER', N'Sea Serpent', N'The Great Ocean Lord, who reigns over the depths, is served by these lancers. Deep-sea creatures exist in fear of facing the stream of attacks their lances are capable of.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1959, N'PTDN', 79407975, N'PTDN', N'Rainbow Dark Dragon', N'Effect', 4000, 0, 10, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'(This card is always treated as an "Ultimate Crystal" card.)
Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 7 DARK monsters with different names from your GY. You can banish all other DARK monsters from your field and GY; this card gains 500 ATK for each card banished this way.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1960, N'PTDN', 5592689, N'PTDN', N'Samsara Lotus', N'Effect', 0, 0, 1, N'DARK', N'Plant', N'During your End Phase, if you control no Spell or Trap Cards, you can Special Summon this card from your Graveyard in face-up Attack Position. This card''s controller takes 1000 damage during each of their Standby Phases.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1961, N'PTDN', 31986288, N'PTDN', N'Regenerating Rose', N'Effect', 0, 1500, 7, N'DARK', N'Plant', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can Special Summon 2 "Regenerating Rose Tokens" (Plant-Type/DARK/Level 3/ATK 1200/DEF 1200).', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1962, N'PTDN', 78371393, N'PTDN', N'Yubel', N'Effect', 0, 0, 10, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'This card cannot be destroyed by battle. You take no Battle Damage from battles involving this card. Before damage calculation, when this face-up Attack Position card is attacked by an opponent''s monster: Inflict damage to your opponent equal to that monster''s ATK. During your End Phase: Tribute 1 other monster or destroy this card. When this card is destroyed, except by its own effect: Its owner can Special Summon 1 "Yubel - Terror Incarnate" from their hand, Deck, or Graveyard.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1963, N'PTDN', 4779091, N'PTDN', N'Yubel - Terror Incarnate', N'Effect', 0, 0, 11, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. Must be Special Summoned by "Yubel", and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. This card cannot be destroyed by battle. You take no Battle Damage from battles involving this card. Before damage calculation, when this face-up Attack Position card is attacked by an opponent''s monster: Inflict damage to your opponent equal to that monster''s ATK. During your End Phase: Destroy all other monsters on the field. When this face-up card leaves the field: You can Special Summon 1 "Yubel - The Ultimate Nightmare" from your hand, Deck, or Graveyard.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1964, N'PTDN', 31764700, N'PTDN', N'Yubel - The Ultimate Nightmare', N'Effect', 0, 0, 12, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. Must be Special Summoned by "Yubel - Terror Incarnate", and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. This card cannot be destroyed by battle. You take no Battle Damage from battles involving this card. At the end of the Damage Step, if this face-up Attack Position card battles an opponent''s monster: Inflict damage equal to that monster''s ATK to your opponent, also destroy that monster.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:13'),
    (1965, N'PTDN', 67159705, N'PTDN', N'Armored Cybern', N'Effect', 0, 2000, 4, N'WIND', N'Machine', N'Once per turn, you can either: Target 1 "Cyber Dragon" you control, or 1 Fusion Monster you control that lists "Cyber Dragon" as Fusion Material; equip this card to that target, OR: Unequip this card and Special Summon it. Once per turn, while equipped to a monster by this effect: You can target 1 face-up monster on the field; the equipped monster loses exactly 1000 ATK (even if this card leaves the field), and if it does, destroy that target. If the equipped monster would be destroyed by battle or card effect, destroy this card instead.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1966, N'PTDN', 3657444, N'PTDN', N'Cyber Valley', N'Effect', 0, 0, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'You can use 1 of these effects.
● When this card is targeted for an attack by an opponent''s monster: You can banish this card; draw 1 card, then end the Battle Phase.
● You can target 1 face-up monster you control and this card; banish both that target and this card, then draw 2 cards.
● You can target 1 card in your GY; banish both this card and 1 card from your hand, then place that target on top of the Deck.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1967, N'PTDN', 30042158, N'PTDN', N'Cyber Ouroboros', N'Effect', 100, 600, 2, N'DARK', N'Machine', N'When this card is removed from play, you can send 1 card from your hand to the Graveyard to draw 1 card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1968, N'PTDN', 66436257, N'PTDN', N'Volcanic Counter', N'Effect', 300, 1300, 3, N'FIRE', N'Pyro', N'When you take battle damage while this card is in your Graveyard: Banish it from your Graveyard, then if there is a FIRE monster other than "Volcanic Counter" in your Graveyard, inflict damage to your opponent equal to the amount of battle damage you took.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1969, N'PTDN', 53927679, N'PTDN', N'Fire Trooper', N'Effect', 1000, 1000, 3, N'FIRE', N'Warrior', N'When this card is Summoned, you can send it to the Graveyard to inflict 1000 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1970, N'PTDN', 93431862, N'PTDN', N'Destiny HERO - Dunker', N'Effect', 1200, 1700, 4, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'You can send 1 "Destiny HERO" card from your hand to the Graveyard; inflict 500 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1971, N'PTDN', 39829561, N'PTDN', N'Destiny HERO - Departed', N'Effect', 1000, 0, 2, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'During your Standby Phase, if this card is in your Graveyard: Special Summon it in face-up Attack Position to your opponent''s side of the field. If this card is destroyed by battle, banish it instead of sending it to the Graveyard. If a card effect would send this card to the Graveyard from the hand or Deck, banish it instead.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1972, N'PTDN', 66214679, N'PTDN', N'Dark Horus', N'Effect', 3000, 1800, 8, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'Once per turn, after resolving a Spell Card that was activated during your opponent''s Main Phase: You can target 1 Level 4 DARK monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target. This card must be face-up on the field to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1973, N'PTDN', 92719314, N'PTDN', N'The Dark Creator', N'Effect', 2300, 3000, 8, N'DARK', N'Thunder', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by having 5 or more DARK monsters in your Graveyard while you control no monsters. Once per turn: You can banish 1 DARK monster from your Graveyard to target 1 DARK monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1974, N'PTDN', 38107923, N'PTDN', N'Dark Nephthys', N'Effect', 2400, 1600, 8, N'DARK', N'Winged Beast', N'If you have 3 or more DARK monsters in your Graveyard and this card in your hand: You can banish 2 of them from your Graveyard; send this card from your hand to the Graveyard. During your next Standby Phase after this card was sent to the Graveyard by this effect: Special Summon this card from the Graveyard. When this card is Special Summoned: Target 1 Spell/Trap Card on the field; destroy that target.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1975, N'PTDN', 65192027, N'PTDN', N'Dark Armed Dragon', N'Effect', 2800, 1000, 7, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by having exactly 3 DARK monsters in your GY. You can banish 1 DARK monster from your GY, then target 1 card on the field; destroy that target.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1976, N'PTDN', 91596726, N'PTDN', N'Dark Crusader', N'Effect', 1600, 200, 4, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'You can send 1 DARK monster from your hand to the Graveyard; this card gains 400 ATK.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1977, N'PTDN', 28985331, N'PTDN', N'Armageddon Knight', N'Effect', 1400, 1200, 4, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'When this card is Summoned: You can send 1 DARK monster from your Deck to the GY.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1978, N'PTDN', 64379430, N'PTDN', N'Doomsday Horror', N'Effect', -1, -1, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'This card''s ATK and DEF are equal to the number of banished DARK monsters x 300. If this card is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard: Return all banished DARK monsters to the Graveyards.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1979, N'PTDN', 90464188, N'PTDN', N'Obsidian Dragon', N'Effect', 800, 2100, 4, N'DARK', N'Rock', N'Negate the effects of Spell and Trap Cards that target only 1 face-up DARK monster you control, and destroy them.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1980, N'PTDN', 27869883, N'PTDN', N'Shadowpriestess of Ohm', N'Effect', 1700, 1600, 4, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Tribute 1 face-up DARK monster you control to inflict 800 damage to your opponent.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1981, N'PTDN', 26254876, N'PTDN', N'Gemini Lancer', N'Monster', 1800, 1400, 4, N'WATER', N'Sea Serpent', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
● During battle between this attacking card and a Defense Position monster whose DEF is lower than the ATK of this card, inflict the difference as Battle Damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1982, N'PTDN', 53257892, N'PTDN', N'Gigaplant', N'Monster', 2400, 1200, 6, N'EARTH', N'Plant', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the GY. While this card is a Normal Monster on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it become an Effect Monster with this effect.
● Once per turn: You can Special Summon 1 Insect or Plant monster from your hand or GY.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1983, N'PTDN', 90642597, N'PTDN', N'Future Samurai', N'Monster', 1600, 1200, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it become an Effect Monster with this effect.
● Once per turn: You can banish 1 monster from your Graveyard to target 1 face-up monster on the field; destroy that target.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1984, N'PTDN', 26046205, N'PTDN', N'Vengeful Shinobi', N'Effect', 400, 800, 2, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'When this face-up Attack Position card is targeted for an attack: Draw 1 card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1985, N'PTDN', 52035300, N'PTDN', N'The Immortal Bushi', N'Effect', 1200, 600, 3, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'While this card is face-up on the field, it cannot be Tributed, except for the Tribute Summon of a Warrior-Type monster. During your Standby Phase, if this card is in your Graveyard and all the monsters in your Graveyard are Warrior-Type: You can Special Summon this card. You must also control no monsters to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1986, N'PTDN', 89529919, N'PTDN', N'Field-Commander Rahz', N'Effect', 1600, 1200, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'When this card is Normal or Special Summoned: Choose 1 Level 4 or lower Warrior-Type monster from your Deck, except "Field-Commander Rahz", and place it on top of your Deck.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1987, N'PTDN', 25924653, N'PTDN', N'Gladiator Beast Darius', N'Effect', 1700, 300, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'When this card is Special Summoned by the effect of a "Gladiator Beast" monster: You can target 1 "Gladiator Beast" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target, but its effect(s) is negated by this card, and it is shuffled into the Deck when this card leaves the field. At the end of the Battle Phase, if this card attacked or was attacked: You can shuffle it into the Deck; Special Summon 1 "Gladiator Beast" monster from your Deck, except "Gladiator Beast Darius".', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1988, N'PTDN', 52248570, N'PTDN', N'Imprisoned Queen Archfiend', N'Effect', 2600, 1700, 8, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'During each of your Standby Phases, you must pay 1000 Life Points (this is not optional), or this card is destroyed. During your Standby Phase: Target 1 Level 4 or lower Fiend-Type monster on the field; that target gains 1000 ATK until the End Phase. "Pandemonium" must be on the field and this card must be in your Graveyard to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1989, N'PTDN', 52319752, N'PTDN', N'Black Veloci', N'Effect', 1800, 300, 4, N'EARTH', N'Dinosaur', N'If this card attacks an opponent''s monster, this card gains 400 ATK during the Damage Step only. If this card is attacked by an opponent''s monster, this card loses 400 ATK during the Damage Step only.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1990, N'PTDN', 88307361, N'PTDN', N'Superancient Deepsea King Coelacanth', N'Effect', 2800, 2200, 7, N'WATER', N'Fish', N'Once per turn: You can discard 1 card; Special Summon as many Level 4 or lower Fish-Type monsters as possible from your Deck, but they cannot declare an attack and their effects are negated. During either player''s turn, when this face-up card on the field is targeted by a card effect: You can Tribute 1 other Fish-Type monster; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card.', N'ULTRA RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1991, N'PTDN', 14702066, N'PTDN', N'Cannon Soldier MK-2', N'Effect', 1900, 1200, 5, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'You can Tribute 2 monsters to inflict 1500 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1992, N'PTDN', 51196174, N'PTDN', N'The Calculator', N'Effect', -1, 0, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Thunder', N'The ATK of this card is the combined Levels of all face-up monsters you control x 300.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1993, N'PTDN', 87685879, N'PTDN', N'Sea Koala', N'Effect', 100, 1600, 2, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'Once per turn: You can target 1 monster your opponent controls; change its ATK to 0 until the end of this turn. You must control a Beast-Type monster (other than this card) to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1994, N'PTDN', 14089428, N'PTDN', N'Blue Thunder T-45', N'Effect', 1700, 1000, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle: Special Summon 1 "Thunder Option Token" (Machine-Type/LIGHT/Level 4/ATK 1500/DEF 1500). This Token cannot be Tributed for a Tribute Summon.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1995, N'PTDN', 50074522, N'PTDN', N'Magnetic Mosquito', N'Effect', 300, 1000, 3, N'LIGHT', N'Insect', N'FLIP: Destroy all face-up Machine-Type monsters on the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1996, N'PTDN', 53461122, N'PTDN', N'Earth Effigy', N'Effect', 100, 2000, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'This card can be treated as 2 Tributes for the Tribute Summon of an EARTH Normal Monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1997, N'PTDN', 99865167, N'PTDN', N'Wind Effigy', N'Effect', 1800, 200, 4, N'WIND', N'Winged Beast', N'This card can be treated as 2 Tributes for the Tribute Summon of a WIND Normal Monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1998, N'PTDN', 13857930, N'PTDN', N'Neo-Spacian Twinkle Moss', N'Fusion', 500, 1100, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Plant', N'This card''s name is also treated as "Neo-Spacian Glow Moss". This card cannot be Special Summoned except with "NEX". When this card attacks or is attacked, draw 1 card. Reveal that card, and based on its type apply the proper effect: ● Monster: End the Battle Phase. ● Spell: You can change this card''s attack to a direct attack. ● Trap: This monster is changed to Defense Position.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (1999, N'PTDN', 49352945, N'PTDN', N'Elemental HERO Storm Neos', N'Fusion', 3000, 2500, 9, N'WIND', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Neos" + "Neo-Spacian Air Hummingbird" + "Neo-Spacian Aqua Dolphin"
Must first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by shuffling the above cards you control into the Deck. (You do not use "Polymerization".) Once per turn: You can destroy all Spell and Trap Cards on the field. During the End Phase: Shuffle this card into the Extra Deck. When this card is shuffled into the Extra Deck this way: Shuffle all cards on the field into the Deck.', N'SUPER RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14'),
    (2000, N'PTDN', 86346643, N'PTDN', N'Rainbow Neos', N'Fusion', 4500, 3000, 10, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'"Elemental HERO Neos" + 1 "Ultimate Crystal" monster
Must be Fusion Summoned with the above Fusion Material Monsters and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. Once per turn: You can activate 1 of these effects. ● Send 1 monster you control to the Graveyard; shuffle all monsters your opponent controls into the Deck. ● Send 1 Spell/Trap Card you control to the Graveyard; shuffle all Spell and Trap Cards your opponent controls into the Deck. ● Send 1 card from the top of your Deck to the Graveyard; shuffle all cards in your opponent''s Graveyard into the Deck.', N'SECRET RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:14');
