    (2314, N'CSOC', 69584564, N'CSOC-EN058', N'Fragrance Storm', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Target 1 Plant-Type monster on the field; destroy that target, and if you do, draw 1 card, then if that card is a Plant-Type monster, you can reveal it and draw 1 more card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2315, N'CSOC', 5973663, N'CSOC-EN059', N'The World Tree', N'Continuous Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Continuous', N'Each time a face-up Plant-Type monster(s) on the field is destroyed, place 1 Flower Counter on this card. You can remove any number of Flower Counters from this card to activate these effects.
● 1 Counter: Target 1 Plant-Type monster on the field; that target gains 400 ATK and DEF until the end of this turn. (This ATK gain remains even if this card leaves the field.)
● 2 Counters: Target 1 card on the field; destroy that target.
● 3 Counters: Target 1 Plant-Type monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2316, N'CSOC', 31467372, N'CSOC-EN060', N'Everliving Underworld Cannon', N'Continuous Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Continuous', N'Once per turn, when a Zombie-Type monster is Special Summoned to your side of the field: Inflict 800 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2317, N'CSOC', 68462976, N'CSOC-EN061', N'Secret Village of the Spellcasters', N'Field Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Field', N'If only you control a Spellcaster monster, your opponent cannot activate Spell Cards. If you control no Spellcaster monsters, you cannot activate Spell Cards.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2318, N'CSOC', 4857085, N'CSOC-EN062', N'Omega Goggles', N'Equip Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Equip', N'Equip only to a monster you control. Once per turn, you can look at 1 random card in your opponent''s hand. The equipped monster cannot attack the turn you activate this effect.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2319, N'CSOC', 31245780, N'CSOC-EN063', N'Battle Mania', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Activate only during your opponent''s Standby Phase. All face-up monsters your opponent controls are changed to Attack Position, and cannot change their battle positions this turn. All monsters your opponent currently controls must attack this turn, if able.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2320, N'CSOC', 67630339, N'CSOC-EN064', N'Confusion Chaff', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Activate only when your opponent declares a second direct attack during the same Battle Phase. Conduct battle between the attacking monster and the first monster that attacked directly (other effects cannot be activated during this battle).', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2321, N'CSOC', 94634433, N'CSOC-EN065', N'Urgent Tuning', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'During the Battle Phase: Immediately after this effect resolves, Synchro Summon 1 Synchro Monster using monsters you control.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2322, N'CSOC', 30123142, N'CSOC-EN066', N'Synchro Strike', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Target Synchro Summoned monster gains 500 ATK for each Synchro Material Monster used to Summon it, until the End Phase.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2323, N'CSOC', 66518841, N'CSOC-EN067', N'Prideful Roar', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'During damage calculation, if your monster battles an opponent''s monster with a higher ATK: Pay LP equal to the difference in ATK; your monster gains ATK equal to that difference +300, during damage calculation only.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2324, N'CSOC', 93912845, N'CSOC-EN068', N'Revival Gift', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Select 1 Tuner monster from your Graveyard and Special Summon it. Its effects are negated. Special Summon 2 "Gift Fiend Tokens" (Fiend-Type/DARK/Level 3/ATK 1500/DEF 1500) to your opponent''s side of the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2325, N'CSOC', 29307554, N'CSOC-EN069', N'Lineage of Destruction', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Activate only during a turn in which you destroyed a Defense Position monster your opponent controlled. Select 1 Level 8 monster you control. During this turn, the selected monster can attack twice.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2326, N'CSOC', 66395299, N'CSOC-EN070', N'Doppelganger', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Continuous', N'When you take damage from the effect of a monster your opponent controls, inflict the same amount of damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2327, N'CSOC', 92890308, N'CSOC-EN071', N'Morphtransition', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Activate only when a face-up "Morphtronic" monster you control is selected as an attack target. Negate the attack, and change the battle position of the selected "Morphtronic" monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
