    (2352, N'CSOC', 68722455, N'CSOC-EN096', N'Red Ogre', N'Effect Monster', 2800, 2100, 7, N'EARTH', N'Zombie', N'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can send any number of cards from your hand to the Graveyard, then target the same number of cards on the field; return those targets to the hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
