    (2470, N'RGBT', 84592800, N'RGBT-EN015', N'Morphtronic Videon', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'● While in Attack Position: This card gains 800 ATK for each Equip Card equipped to it. 
