    (2544, N'RGBT', 91133740, N'RGBT-EN094', N'Snowman Eater', N'Effect Monster', 0, 1900, 3, N'WATER', N'Aqua', N'If this card is flipped face-up: Target 1 face-up monster on the field; destroy that target.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2545, N'RGBT', 71759912, N'RGBT-EN095', N'Tree Otter', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 100, 2, N'WATER', N'Beast', N'Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster you control; it gains 1000 ATK until the end of this turn. You must control a Beast-Type monster (other than this card) to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2546, N'RGBT', 37132349, N'RGBT-EN096', N'Ojama Red', N'Effect Monster', 0, 1000, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can Special Summon up to 4 "Ojama" monsters from your hand in Attack Position.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2547, N'RGBT', 64627453, N'RGBT-EN097', N'Ojama Blue', N'Effect Monster', 0, 1000, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: You can add 2 "Ojama" cards from your Deck to your hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2548, N'RGBT', 90011152, N'RGBT-EN098', N'Ojama Country', N'Field Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Field', N'Once per turn, you can send 1 "Ojama" card from your hand to the Graveyard to Special Summon 1 "Ojama" monster from your Graveyard. While you control a face-up "Ojama" monster, switch the original ATK and DEF of all monsters on the field. ("Ojama" can include "Ojamuscle".)', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2549, N'RGBT', 21672573, N'RGBT-EN099', N'Emperor Sem', N'Effect Monster', 1300, 2200, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Fiend', N'Each time you Tribute Summon a monster, each player can select 1 card from their Graveyard and return it to the top of their Deck.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2550, N'RGBT', 36623431, N'RGBT-ENPP1', N'Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'During your Draw Phase, if this card is in your Graveyard, you can add this card to your hand instead of drawing, and/or send 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" monster from your hand to your Graveyard to add this card to your hand.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2551, N'RGBT', 58820853, N'RGBT-ENPP2', N'Blackwing - Shura the Blue Flame', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1200, 4, N'DARK', N'Winged Beast', N'When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard: You can Special Summon 1 "Blackwing" monster with 1500 or less ATK from your Deck, but its effects are negated.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2552, N'RGBT', 45041488, N'RGBT-ENPP3', N'Koa''ki Meiru Guardian', N'Effect Monster', 1900, 1200, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the GY or reveal 1 Rock monster in your hand. When a monster effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that monster.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2553, N'RGBT', 94878265, N'RGBT-ENPP4', N'Moja', N'Effect Monster', 100, 100, 1, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can add 1 Level 4 Beast-Type monster from your Graveyard to your hand.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2554, N'RGBT', 16191953, N'RGBT-ENPP5', N'Master Gig', N'Effect Monster', 2600, 1400, 8, N'EARTH', N'Psychic', N'Once per turn, you can pay 1000 Life Points to destroy monsters your opponent controls equal to the number of face-up Psychic-Type monsters you control.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2555, N'RGBT', 86223870, N'RGBT-ENPP6', N'Level Retuner', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Normal', N'Reduce the Level of 1 face-up monster you control by up to 2.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2556, N'ANPR', 42024143, N'ANPR-EN000', N'XX-Saber Gardestrike', N'Effect Monster', 2100, 1400, 5, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'If you have 2 or more "X-Saber" monsters in your Graveyard and control no monsters, you can Special Summon this card from your hand.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2557, N'ANPR', 47432275, N'ANPR-EN001', N'Kuribon', N'Effect Monster', 300, 200, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Fairy', N'During damage calculation, if this card is attacked by your opponent''s monster: You can activate this effect; you take no battle damage from that battle, your opponent gains LP equal to the attacking monster''s ATK, also you return this card to your hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2558, N'ANPR', 73837870, N'ANPR-EN002', N'Sunny Pixie', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 300, 400, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Spellcaster', N'If this card is sent to the Graveyard for the Synchro Summon of a LIGHT Synchro Monster: Gain 1000 Life Points.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2559, N'ANPR', 10321588, N'ANPR-EN003', N'Sunlight Unicorn', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1000, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'Once per turn: You can excavate the top card of your Deck, and if it is an Equip Spell Card, add it to your hand. Otherwise, place it on the bottom of your Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2560, N'ANPR', 46710683, N'ANPR-EN004', N'Blackwing - Mistral the Silver Shield', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 100, 1800, 2, N'DARK', N'Winged Beast', N'If this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard: Reduce the next battle damage you would take this turn to 0.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2561, N'ANPR', 72714392, N'ANPR-EN005', N'Blackwing - Vayu the Emblem of Honor', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 800, 0, 1, N'DARK', N'Winged Beast', N'This face-up card on the field cannot be used as a Synchro Material. If this card is in the Graveyard: You can target 1 non-Tuner "Blackwing" monster in your Graveyard; banish both this card and that target, and if you do, Special Summon 1 "Blackwing" Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck whose Level equals the total Levels of the banished monsters, but its effects are negated.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2562, N'ANPR', 9109991, N'ANPR-EN006', N'Blackwing - Fane the Steel Chain', N'Effect Monster', 500, 800, 2, N'DARK', N'Winged Beast', N'This card can attack your opponent directly. If this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent by a direct attack: Target 1 Attack Position monster your opponent controls; change that target to Defense Position.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2563, N'ANPR', 45593005, N'ANPR-EN007', N'Morphtronic Magnen Bar', N'Effect Monster', 100, 100, 1, N'EARTH', N'Thunder', N'● While in Attack Position: Once per turn, if you control exactly 2 other face-up Attack Position monsters, and no additional monsters, this card gains the combined ATK of the other two monsters you control until the End Phase. The other two monsters cannot attack the turn you activate this effect.
● While in Defense Position: Monsters you control cannot attack.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2564, N'ANPR', 72992744, N'ANPR-EN008', N'Jester Lord', N'Effect Monster', 0, 0, 1, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'While this card is the only monster on the field, it gains 1000 ATK for each card in the Spell & Trap Card Zones.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2565, N'ANPR', 8487449, N'ANPR-EN009', N'Jester Confit', N'Effect Monster', 0, 0, 1, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'You can only control 1 "Jester Confit". You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) in Attack Position. If Summoned this way, during your opponent''s next End Phase: Target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; return both that target and this face-up card to the hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2566, N'ANPR', 34471458, N'ANPR-EN010', N'Fortune Lady Light', N'Effect Monster', -1, -1, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Spellcaster', N'This card''s ATK/DEF become its Level x 200. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Increase this card''s Level by 1 (max. 12). When this face-up card leaves the field by card effect: You can Special Summon 1 "Fortune Lady" monster from your Deck.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2567, N'ANPR', 71870152, N'ANPR-EN011', N'Fortune Lady Fire', N'Effect Monster', -1, -1, 2, N'FIRE', N'Spellcaster', N'This card''s ATK/DEF become its Level x 200. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Increase this card''s Level by 1 (max. 12). When this card is Special Summoned in Attack Position by the effect of a "Fortune Lady" card: Target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; destroy that target, and if you do, inflict damage to your opponent equal to the destroyed monster''s ATK on the field.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2568, N'ANPR', 7264861, N'ANPR-EN012', N'Infernity Beast', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1200, 3, N'DARK', N'Beast', N'If this card attacks while you have no cards in your hand, your opponent cannot activate any Spell or Trap Cards until after the Damage Step.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2569, N'ANPR', 34659866, N'ANPR-EN013', N'Darksea Rescue', N'Effect Monster', 0, 0, 1, N'DARK', N'Machine', N'If this card is used for a Synchro Summon and sent to the Graveyard, the owner of this card draws 1 card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2570, N'ANPR', 70054514, N'ANPR-EN014', N'Darksea Float', N'Effect Monster', 0, 300, 1, N'DARK', N'Machine', N'When this card on the field is destroyed by a card effect and sent to the Graveyard, the owner of this card draws 1 card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2571, N'ANPR', 6142213, N'ANPR-EN015', N'Turbo Rocket', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 0, 0, 2, N'WIND', N'Machine', N'While attacking, this card cannot be destroyed by battle. If this card attacks, after damage calculation, inflict damage equal to half the ATK of the attack target to your opponent.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2572, N'ANPR', 33537328, N'ANPR-EN016', N'Earthbound Immortal Cusillu', N'Effect Monster', 2800, 2400, 10, N'DARK', N'Beast', N'There can only be 1 "Earthbound Immortal" monster on the field. If there is no face-up Field Spell Card on the field, destroy this card. Your opponent cannot target this card for attacks. This card can attack your opponent directly. If this card would be destroyed by battle, you can Tribute 1 other monster instead, and if you do, halve your opponent''s LP.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2573, N'ANPR', 69931927, N'ANPR-EN017', N'Earthbound Immortal Chacu Challhua', N'Effect Monster', 2900, 2400, 10, N'DARK', N'Fish', N'There can only be 1 "Earthbound Immortal" monster on the field. If there is no face-up Field Spell Card on the field, destroy this card. Your opponent cannot target this card for attacks. This card can attack your opponent directly. Once per turn: You can inflict damage to your opponent equal to half this card''s DEF on the field. This card cannot attack during the turn you activate this effect. While this card is in Defense Position, your opponent cannot conduct their Battle Phase.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2574, N'ANPR', 6320631, N'ANPR-EN018', N'Koa''ki Meiru Boulder', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 1000, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can add 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" or 1 Level 4 or lower "Koa''ki Meiru" monster from your Deck to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2575, N'ANPR', 32314730, N'ANPR-EN019', N'Koa''ki Meiru Crusader', N'Effect Monster', 1900, 1300, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Beast-Warrior-Type monster in your hand. If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle, you can add 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" card from your Graveyard to your hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2576, N'ANPR', 68809475, N'ANPR-EN020', N'Koa''ki Meiru Speeder', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 2200, 3, N'WIND', N'Machine', N'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Machine-Type monster in your hand. If you draw "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" during your Draw Phase, you can reveal it to your opponent to draw 1 more card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2577, N'ANPR', 95204084, N'ANPR-EN021', N'Koa''ki Meiru Tornado', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1200, 4, N'WIND', N'Winged Beast', N'You can return 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the top of the Deck to destroy all Special Summoned monsters your opponent controls.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2578, N'ANPR', 31692182, N'ANPR-EN022', N'Koa''ki Meiru Hydro Barrier', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1900, 3, N'WATER', N'Aqua', N'You can return 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the top of the Deck. If you do, the effect(s) of all face-up Effect Monsters are negated until the Standby Phase of your next turn, except "Koa''ki Meiru" monsters.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
