    (2583, N'ANPR', 93369354, N'ANPR-EN027', N'Fishborg Blaster', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 100, 200, 1, N'WATER', N'Fish', N'If you control a face-up Level 3 or lower WATER monster: You can discard 1 card; Special Summon this card from your Graveyard. If this card is used as a Synchro Material Monster, all other Synchro Material Monsters must be WATER.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
