    (2585, N'ANPR', 62742651, N'ANPR-EN029', N'Armored Axon Kicker', N'Effect Monster', 2200, 1800, 6, N'EARTH', N'Psychic', N'If you control a face-up Psychic-Type monster, you can Normal Summon this card without Tributing. If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle, you take damage equal to half the destroyed monster''s ATK. Then, you can Special Summon 1 monster from your Graveyard with ATK less than or equal to the damage you took.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2586, N'ANPR', 98147766, N'ANPR-EN030', N'Genetic Woman', N'Effect Monster', 1700, 1200, 4, N'WIND', N'Psychic', N'Once per turn, you can pay 1000 Life Points and select 1 of your removed from play Psychic-Type monsters. Add it to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2587, N'ANPR', 25531465, N'ANPR-EN031', N'Magicat', N'Effect Monster', 600, 500, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Spellcaster', N'If this card is sent to the Graveyard for the Synchro Summon of a Spellcaster-Type Synchro Monster, you can return 1 Spell Card from your Graveyard to the top of your Deck.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2588, N'ANPR', 51020079, N'ANPR-EN032', N'Cyborg Doctor', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1700, 4, N'EARTH', N'Spellcaster', N'Once per turn, you can Tribute 1 Tuner monster you control to Special Summon a monster from your Graveyard with the same Attribute and Level as the Tributed monster.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2589, N'ANPR', 98024118, N'ANPR-EN033', N'White Potan', N'Effect Monster', 100, 200, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Fairy', N'If you control a face-up Tuner monster, this card cannot be destroyed by battle. When a face-up Tuner monster you control is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, inflict 500 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2590, N'ANPR', 24419823, N'ANPR-EN034', N'Minefieldriller', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'When this face-up card you control leaves the field and is still in your possession: You can target 1 Field Spell Card in your Graveyard; add that target to your hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
