    (2593, N'ANPR', 23297235, N'ANPR-EN037', N'Flamvell Firedog', N'Effect Monster', 1900, 200, 4, N'FIRE', N'Beast', N'When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the GY: You can Special Summon 1 FIRE monster with 200 or less DEF from your Deck, except "Flamvell Firedog".', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2594, N'ANPR', 50781944, N'ANPR-EN038', N'Ancient Crimson Ape', N'Effect Monster', 2600, 1800, 7, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'When a monster(s) you control is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, gain 1000 Life Points.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2595, N'ANPR', 86170989, N'ANPR-EN039', N'Falchion Beta', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 800, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle: Activate 1 of these effects.
● Send 1 LIGHT Machine-Type monster with 1200 or less ATK from your Deck to your Graveyard.
● Target 1 LIGHT Machine-Type monster with 1200 or less ATK in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2596, N'ANPR', 25862681, N'ANPR-EN040', N'Ancient Fairy Dragon', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2100, 3000, 7, N'LIGHT', N'Dragon', N'1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters
During your Main Phase: You can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower monster from your hand. You cannot conduct your Battle Phase the turn you activate this effect. During your Main Phase: You can destroy as many cards in the Field Zones as possible (min. 1), and if you do, gain 1000 LP, then you can add 1 Field Spell with a different name than the destroyed card(s), from your Deck to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Ancient Fairy Dragon" once per turn.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2597, N'ANPR', 13574687, N'ANPR-EN041', N'Turbo Cannon', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 0, 0, 3, N'FIRE', N'Machine', N'"Turbo Rocket" + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters
Once per turn, you can destroy 1 face-up monster on the field and inflict damage to its controller equal to half of its ATK.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:15'),
    (2598, N'ANPR', 59969392, N'ANPR-EN042', N'Archfiend Zombie-Skull', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2500, 1200, 6, N'DARK', N'Zombie', N'"Plaguespreader Zombie" + 2+ non-Tuner Zombie monsters
