    (2726, N'SOVR', 29934351, N'SOVR-EN070', N'Earthbound Wave', N'Counter Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Counter', N'When your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card while you control a "Earthbound Immortal" monster: Negate the activation, and if you do, destroy it.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2727, N'SOVR', 56339050, N'SOVR-EN071', N'Roar of the Earthbound Immortal', N'Continuous Trap', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Continuous', N'Once per turn, if an opponent''s monster declares an attack: Target the attacking monster; destroy that target, and if you do, inflict damage to your opponent equal to half the destroyed monster''s ATK. You must control an "Earthbound Immortal" monster with ATK higher than the ATK of the attacking monster to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
