    (2745, N'SOVR', 27970830, N'SOVR-EN089', N'Gateway of the Six', N'Continuous Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Continuous', N'Each time a "Six Samurai" monster(s) is Normal or Special Summoned, place 2 Bushido Counters on this card. You can remove Bushido Counters from your field to activate these effects.
