    (2760, N'ABPF', 56286179, N'ABPF-EN004', N'Drill Synchron', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 800, 300, 3, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'If a Warrior-Type monster you control attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage to your opponent. Once per turn, when you inflict battle damage to your opponent with this effect: You can draw 1 card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
