    (2762, N'ABPF', 19665973, N'ABPF-EN006', N'Battle Fader', N'Effect Monster', 0, 0, 1, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'When an opponent''s monster declares a direct attack: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, then end the Battle Phase. If Summoned this way, banish it when it leaves the field.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
