    (2771, N'ABPF', 16008155, N'ABPF-EN015', N'Reptilianne Servant', N'Effect Monster', 100, 100, 1, N'DARK', N'Reptile', N'Destroy this card if there are face-up monsters on the field other than this card. Destroy this card when it is targeted by the effect of a Spell or Trap Card. Neither player can Normal Summon a monster while this card is face-up on the field.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2772, N'ABPF', 43002864, N'ABPF-EN016', N'Reptilianne Gardna', N'Effect Monster', 0, 2000, 4, N'WATER', N'Reptile', N'When this card you control is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, add 1 "Reptilianne" monster from your Deck to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2773, N'ABPF', 79491903, N'ABPF-EN017', N'Reptilianne Naga', N'Effect Monster', 0, 0, 1, N'DARK', N'Reptile', N'This card cannot be destroyed by battle. The ATK of any monster that battles this card becomes 0 at the end of that Battle Phase. During your End Phase, change this face-up Defense Position card on the field to face-up Attack Position.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2774, N'ABPF', 16886617, N'ABPF-EN018', N'Reptilianne Vaskii', N'Effect Monster', 2600, 0, 8, N'DARK', N'Reptile', N'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card cannot be Special Summoned except by Tributing 2 face-up monsters with 0 ATK from anywhere on the field. Once per turn, you can select and destroy 1 face-up monster your opponent controls. There can only be 1 face-up "Reptilianne Vaskii" on the field.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2775, N'ABPF', 42280216, N'ABPF-EN019', N'Oracle of the Sun', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 2000, 5, N'LIGHT', N'Spellcaster', N'If only your opponent controls a monster, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). When this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the GY: You can add 1 "Fire Ant Ascator" or "Supay" from your Deck to your hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2776, N'ABPF', 78275321, N'ABPF-EN020', N'Fire Ant Ascator', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 700, 1300, 3, N'EARTH', N'Insect', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: You can target 1 Level 5 monster in your GY; Special Summon that target, but its effects are negated, also send it to the GY during the End Phase of this turn.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2777, N'ABPF', 5763020, N'ABPF-EN021', N'Weeping Idol', N'Effect Monster', 0, 500, 2, N'DARK', N'Rock', N'You can remove from play 1 Tuner monster in your Graveyard to Special Summon this card from your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2778, N'ABPF', 41158734, N'ABPF-EN022', N'Apocatequil', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1200, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Thunder', N'While this card is face-up on the field, it is Level 5 if you control a face-up Tuner monster. When this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, you can select and Special Summon 1 "Oracle of the Sun" from your Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2779, N'ABPF', 78552773, N'ABPF-EN023', N'Supay', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 300, 100, 1, N'EARTH', N'Fiend', N'When this card is sent from the field to the GY by card effect: You can Special Summon 1 "Oracle of the Sun" from your Deck, and if you do, double its ATK, also return it to the hand during the End Phase of this turn.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2780, N'ABPF', 4941482, N'ABPF-EN024', N'Informer Spider', N'Effect Monster', 500, 1800, 4, N'EARTH', N'Insect', N'When this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard by a card effect, take control of 1 Defense Position monster your opponent controls.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2781, N'ABPF', 30936186, N'ABPF-EN025', N'Koa''ki Meiru Urnight', N'Effect Monster', 2000, 1500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Beast-Warrior-Type monster in your hand. Once per turn, you can reveal 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" in your hand to Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Koa''ki Meiru" monster from your Deck, except "Koa''ki Meiru Urnight".', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2782, N'ABPF', 77330185, N'ABPF-EN026', N'XX-Saber Garsem', N'Effect Monster', 1400, 400, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'When this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard by a card effect, add 1 "X-Saber" monster from your Deck to your hand. This card gains 200 ATK for each face-up "X-Saber" monster you control.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2783, N'ABPF', 3825890, N'ABPF-EN027', N'Gravekeeper''s Visionary', N'Effect Monster', 2000, 1800, 8, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Tribute Summon this card by Tributing 1 "Gravekeeper''s" monster. This card gains 200 ATK for each "Gravekeeper''s" monster in your Graveyard. If this face-up card would be destroyed, you can discard 1 "Gravekeeper''s" monster instead.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2784, N'ABPF', 30213599, N'ABPF-EN028', N'Gravekeeper''s Descendant', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1200, 4, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Tribute 1 other face-up "Gravekeeper''s" monster to target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy that target.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2785, N'ABPF', 76218643, N'ABPF-EN029', N'Black Potan', N'Effect Monster', 200, 100, 1, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'If you control a face-up Tuner monster, this card cannot be destroyed by battle. When a face-up Tuner monster(s) you control is removed from the field, gain 800 Life Points.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2786, N'ABPF', 3603242, N'ABPF-EN030', N'Shreddder', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1000, 4, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'Once per turn: You can send 1 Machine-Type monster from your hand to the Graveyard, then target 1 monster your opponent controls with a Level less than or equal to the sent monster''s; destroy that target.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2787, N'ABPF', 39091951, N'ABPF-EN031', N'Pandaborg', N'Effect Monster', 1700, 1400, 4, N'WATER', N'Psychic', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can pay 800 Life Points to Special Summon 1 Level 4 Psychic-Type monster from your Deck.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2788, N'ABPF', 65496056, N'ABPF-EN032', N'Codarus', N'Effect Monster', 1400, 1200, 4, N'WATER', N'Sea Serpent', N'You can send 1 face-up "Umi" you control to the Graveyard to target up to 2 cards your opponent controls; send those targets to the Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2789, N'ABPF', 2980764, N'ABPF-EN033', N'Consecrated Light', N'Effect Monster', 0, 0, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Fairy', N'Neither player can Normal or Special Summon DARK monsters or declare an attack with a DARK monster. This card cannot be destroyed by battle with a DARK monster, also you take no battle damage from that battle.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2790, N'ABPF', 38975369, N'ABPF-EN034', N'Gundari', N'Spirit Effect Monster', 1000, 200, 4, N'FIRE', N'Pyro', N'This card cannot be Special Summoned. This card returns to its owner''s hand during the End Phase of the turn it is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up. If this card battles a Synchro Monster, return both monsters to their owners'' hands at the start of the Damage Step (without damage calculation).', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2791, N'ABPF', 5373478, N'ABPF-EN035', N'Cyber Dragon Zwei', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1000, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'If this card attacks an opponent''s monster, it gains 300 ATK during the Damage Step only. Once per turn: You can reveal 1 Spell in your hand; this card''s name becomes "Cyber Dragon" until the End Phase. This card''s name becomes "Cyber Dragon" while in the GY.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2792, N'ABPF', 31768112, N'ABPF-EN036', N'Oilman', N'Union Effect Monster', 400, 400, 2, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'Once per turn, you can either: Target 1 Machine-Type monster you control; equip this card to that target, OR: Unequip this card and Special Summon it in Attack Position. While equipped by this effect, if the equipped monster destroys an opponent''s monster by battle: Draw 1 card. (A monster can only be equipped with 1 Union monster at a time. If the equipped monster would be destroyed, destroy this card instead.)', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2793, N'ABPF', 77153811, N'ABPF-EN037', N'Djinn Cursenchanter of Rituals', N'Effect Monster', 1700, 1000, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'When you Ritual Summon a monster, you can banish this card from your Graveyard as 1 of the monsters required for the Ritual Summon. While the monster Ritual Summoned using this card is face-up on the field, Synchro Monsters'' effects are negated.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2794, N'ABPF', 4141820, N'ABPF-EN038', N'Djinn Prognosticator of Rituals', N'Effect Monster', 400, 300, 3, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'When you Ritual Summon a monster, you can banish this card from your GY as 1 of the monsters required for the Ritual Summon. If you Ritual Summon using this card, if that Ritual Summoned monster inflicts battle damage to your opponent, they discard 1 card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2795, N'ABPF', 30646525, N'ABPF-EN039', N'Garlandolf, King of Destruction', N'Ritual Effect Monster', 2500, 1400, 7, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'This card can only be Ritual Summoned with the Ritual Spell Card, "Ritual of Destruction". When this card is Ritual Summoned, destroy all other face-up monsters on the field with DEF less than or equal to this card''s ATK. This card gains 100 ATK for each monster destroyed by this effect.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2796, N'ABPF', 67030233, N'ABPF-EN040', N'Majestic Red Dragon', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 4000, 3000, 10, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'"Majestic Dragon" + "Red Dragon Archfiend" + 1 non-Tuner monster
Cannot be destroyed by card effects. After damage calculation, if this card attacks: Destroy all Defense Position monsters on the field. Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; negate its effects, and if you do, this card gains ATK equal to that monster''s ATK. These changes last until the end of this turn. During the End Phase: Target 1 "Red Dragon Archfiend" in your Graveyard; return this card from the field to the Extra Deck, then Special Summon that target.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2797, N'ABPF', 3429238, N'ABPF-EN041', N'Drill Warrior', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2400, 2000, 6, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'"Drill Synchron" + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters
Once per turn, during your Main Phase 1: You can halve this card''s ATK, and if you do, it can attack your opponent directly this turn. Once per turn: You can discard 1 card, and if you do, banish this card. During your next Standby Phase: Special Summon this card banished by this effect, then add 1 monster from your Graveyard to your hand.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2798, N'ABPF', 39823987, N'ABPF-EN042', N'Sun Dragon Inti', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 3000, 2800, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Dragon', N'"Fire Ant Ascator" + 1+ non-Tuner monsters
If this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: Destroy the monster that destroyed this card, and if you do, inflict damage to your opponent equal to half the ATK that monster had on the field. Once per turn, during the Standby Phase of the next turn after this card on the field was destroyed: You can target 1 "Moon Dragon Quilla" in your GY; Special Summon that target.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2799, N'ABPF', 66818682, N'ABPF-EN043', N'Moon Dragon Quilla', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2500, 2000, 6, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'"Supay" + 1+ non-Tuner monsters
If this card is targeted for an attack: Gain LP equal to half the attacking monster''s ATK. If this card on the field is destroyed: You can target 1 "Sun Dragon Inti" in your GY; Special Summon that target.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2800, N'ABPF', 2203790, N'ABPF-EN044', N'XX-Saber Hyunlei', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2300, 1300, 6, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner "X-Saber" monsters
When this card is Synchro Summoned, you can select and destroy up to 3 Spell or Trap Cards on the field.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16');
