    (2946, N'TSHD', 68505803, N'TSHD-EN090', N'Genex Controller', N'Tuner Normal Monster', 1400, 1200, 3, N'DARK', N'Machine', N'As a master of all powers and elements, this is one of the few Genex monsters that can communicate with its companions.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2947, N'TSHD', 4904812, N'TSHD-EN091', N'Genex Undine', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 600, 3, N'WATER', N'Aqua', N'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can send 1 WATER monster from your Deck to the Graveyard; add 1 "Genex Controller" from your Deck to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2948, N'TSHD', 67483216, N'TSHD-EN092', N'Genex Searcher', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 400, 4, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can Special Summon 1 "Genex" monster with 1500 or less ATK from your Deck in face-up Attack Position.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2949, N'TSHD', 96099959, N'TSHD-EN093', N'X-Saber Palomuro', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 200, 300, 1, N'EARTH', N'Reptile', N'When another "Saber" monster you control is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can pay 500 Life Points to Special Summon this card from the Graveyard.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2950, N'TSHD', 23093604, N'TSHD-EN094', N'X-Saber Pashuul', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 100, 0, 2, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'This card cannot be destroyed by battle. During each of your opponent''s Standby Phases: You take 1000 damage. You must control this card in face-up Defense Position to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2951, N'TSHD', 47421985, N'TSHD-EN095', N'Hydro Genex', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2300, 1800, 6, N'WATER', N'Machine', N'"Genex Controller" + 1 or more non-Tuner WATER monsters
When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard, gain Life Points equal to the ATK of the destroyed monster.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2952, N'TSHD', 19204398, N'TSHD-EN096', N'Ally of Justice Light Gazer', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2400, 1600, 8, N'DARK', N'Machine', N'1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters
This card gains 200 ATK for each LIGHT monster in your opponent''s Graveyard.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2953, N'TSHD', 19182751, N'TSHD-EN097', N'Genex Neutron', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1200, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Machine', N'Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card was Normal Summoned this turn: You can add 1 Machine-Type Tuner monster from your Deck to your hand.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2954, N'TSHD', 98954375, N'TSHD-EN098', N'Infernity Destroyer', N'Effect Monster', 2300, 1000, 6, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard: Inflict 1600 damage to your opponent. You must have no cards in your hand to activate and to resolve this effect.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2955, N'TSHD', 80367387, N'TSHD-EN099', N'Koa''ki Meiru Bergzak', N'Effect Monster', 2000, 200, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Warrior-Type monster in your hand. If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle, it can attack once again in a row.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2956, N'DREV', 45815891, N'DREV-EN000', N'Scrap Archfiend', N'Synchro Monster', 2700, 1800, 7, N'EARTH', N'Fiend', N'1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2957, N'DREV', 61864793, N'DREV-EN001', N'Earthquake Giant', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 2100, 5, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'Once per turn, when the battle position of this card is changed, you can select 1 monster your opponent controls and change its battle position.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2958, N'DREV', 97268402, N'DREV-EN002', N'Effect Veiler', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 0, 0, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Spellcaster', N'During your opponent''s Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; negate the effects of that face-up monster your opponent controls, until the end of this turn.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2959, N'DREV', 34257001, N'DREV-EN003', N'Dash Warrior', N'Effect Monster', 600, 1200, 3, N'WIND', N'Warrior', N'If this card attacks, it gains 1200 ATK during the Damage Step only.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2960, N'DREV', 60741115, N'DREV-EN004', N'Damage Eater', N'Effect Monster', 100, 800, 2, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'During your opponent''s turn, when your opponent activates a card or effect that would inflict damage, you can remove from play this card in your Graveyard to change that effect so it increases Life Points by the same amount instead.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2961, N'DREV', 96146814, N'DREV-EN005', N'A/D Changer', N'Effect Monster', 100, 100, 1, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'You can banish this card from your Graveyard, then target 1 monster on the field; change its battle position.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2962, N'DREV', 23535429, N'DREV-EN006', N'Stronghold Guardian', N'Effect Monster', 0, 1500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'If a Defense Position monster you control is attacked, you can send this card from your hand to the Graveyard during the Damage Step to have your attacked monster gain 1500 DEF until the End Phase.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2963, N'DREV', 69529567, N'DREV-EN007', N'Playful Possum', N'Effect Monster', 800, 600, 2, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'During your Main Phase: You can destroy this face-up card on the field. Your opponent must control a monster with a higher ATK than this card for you to activate and to resolve this effect. During your Standby Phase, if this card was destroyed by this effect: You can Special Summon this card from the Graveyard.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2964, N'DREV', 96914272, N'DREV-EN008', N'Egotistical Ape', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 1200, 1200, 5, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned by sending 1 Beast-Type monster from your hand to the Graveyard. When this card is Special Summoned this way, you can activate 1 of these effects: ● Increase the Level of this card by the Level of the Beast-Type monster. ● Decrease the Level of this card by the Level of the Beast-Type monster.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2965, N'DREV', 22318971, N'DREV-EN009', N'Uni-Horned Familiar', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 0, 1000, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'When this face-up Defense Position card is selected as an attack target, you can remove from play 1 monster you control other than this card to remove this card from play. The attacking monster must attack. During your next Standby Phase, if this card was removed from play by this effect, this card returns to the field.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2966, N'DREV', 58807980, N'DREV-EN010', N'Monoceros', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1000, 3, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned by removing from play 1 Spell Card from your hand. When you Synchro Summon using this card and a Beast-Type Tuner monster as the Synchro Material Monsters, you can select 1 Beast-Type Tuner monster used for the Synchro Summon and Special Summon it from the Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2967, N'DREV', 95291684, N'DREV-EN011', N'D.D. Unicorn Knight', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 900, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned if your opponent controls a monster(s) and you control a face-up Tuner monster(s). When this card is Special Summoned this way, you can select 1 of your removed from play Level 3 or lower non-Tuner monsters and Special Summon it. Its effect(s) are negated. You cannot Normal Summon or Set the turn you Special Summon this card.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2968, N'DREV', 21296383, N'DREV-EN012', N'Unibird', N'Effect Monster', 100, 600, 2, N'WIND', N'Winged Beast', N'You can remove from play this face-up card, and 1 face-up monster you control, to select 1 Synchro Monster in your Graveyard with a Level less than or equal to the combined original Levels of the other 2 monsters. Special Summon that Synchro Monster.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2969, N'DREV', 58685438, N'DREV-EN013', N'Bicorn Re''em', N'Effect Monster', 800, 1600, 4, N'DARK', N'Beast', N'If this card is sent to the Graveyard as a Synchro Material Monster for a Synchro Summon, send the top 2 cards from your opponent''s Deck to the Graveyard.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2970, N'DREV', 94079037, N'DREV-EN014', N'Mine Mole', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 1200, 3, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'Once per turn, this card cannot be destroyed by battle. If this card is sent to the Graveyard as a Synchro Material Monster of a Beast-Type monster, draw 1 card. If this card is removed from the field by your opponent''s card effect, remove this card from play.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2971, N'DREV', 20474741, N'DREV-EN015', N'Trident Warrior', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1200, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 Level 3 monster from your hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2972, N'DREV', 57568840, N'DREV-EN016', N'Delta Flyer', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 1500, 900, 3, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'Once per turn, you can select 1 other face-up monster you control and increase its Level by 1.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2973, N'DREV', 83957459, N'DREV-EN017', N'Rhinotaurus', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 600, 4, N'FIRE', N'Beast-Warrior', N'If 2 or more of your opponent''s monsters are destroyed by battle with your monsters during the same Battle Phase, this card can make a second attack during that Battle Phase.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2974, N'DREV', 20351153, N'DREV-EN018', N'Hypnocorn', N'Effect Monster', 1400, 600, 4, N'DARK', N'Beast', N'When this card is Normal Summoned, if your opponent controls a monster and you control no other monsters: You can target 1 Set Spell/Trap Card on the field; destroy that target.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2975, N'DREV', 56746202, N'DREV-EN019', N'Scrap Chimera', N'Effect Monster', 1700, 500, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'This card cannot be used as a Synchro Material Monster, except for the Synchro Summon of a "Scrap" monster, and all other Synchro Material Monsters must also be "Scrap" monsters. When this card is Normal Summoned, you can select 1 "Scrap" Tuner monster in your Graveyard and Special Summon it.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2976, N'DREV', 83135907, N'DREV-EN020', N'Scrap Goblin', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 0, 500, 3, N'EARTH', N'Beast-Warrior', N'This card cannot be destroyed by battle. If this face-up Defense Position card is selected as an attack target, destroy this card at the end of the Battle Phase. If this card is destroyed by the effect of a "Scrap" card and sent to the Graveyard, you can select 1 "Scrap" monster in your Graveyard, except "Scrap Goblin", and add it to your hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2977, N'DREV', 19139516, N'DREV-EN021', N'Scrap Beast', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 1600, 1300, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'If this face-up Defense Position card is targeted for an attack, at the end of the Battle Phase: Destroy this card. If this card is destroyed by the effect of a "Scrap" card and sent to the Graveyard: You can target 1 "Scrap" monster in your Graveyard, except "Scrap Beast"; add that target to your hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2978, N'DREV', 55624610, N'DREV-EN022', N'Scrap Hunter', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 400, 3, N'EARTH', N'Machine', N'Once per turn, you can select 1 face-up "Scrap" monster you control, except this card. Destroy it and send 1 Tuner monster from your Deck to the Graveyard.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2979, N'DREV', 82012319, N'DREV-EN023', N'Scrap Golem', N'Effect Monster', 2300, 1400, 5, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'Once per turn: You can target 1 Level 4 or lower "Scrap" monster in your GY; Special Summon that target to either player''s field.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2980, N'DREV', 18407024, N'DREV-EN024', N'Wattbetta', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 100, 0, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Thunder', N'When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent by a direct attack, your opponent discards 1 card of their choice.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2981, N'DREV', 45801022, N'DREV-EN025', N'Wattlemur', N'Effect Monster', 800, 100, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Thunder', N'If this card in its owner''s possession is destroyed by your opponent''s card (either by battle or by card effect): Your opponent cannot conduct their Battle Phase during their next turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2982, N'DREV', 81896771, N'DREV-EN026', N'Wattpheasant', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 800, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Thunder', N'This card can attack your opponent directly. When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent by a direct attack, select 1 face-up monster on the field and remove it from play until the End Phase of this turn.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2983, N'DREV', 17285476, N'DREV-EN027', N'Naturia Mosquito', N'Effect Monster', 200, 300, 1, N'EARTH', N'Insect', N'While you control another face-up "Naturia" monster(s), your opponent cannot select this card as an attack target. Your opponent takes any Battle Damage you would have taken from battles involving a face-up "Naturia" monster you control, except this card.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2984, N'DREV', 44789585, N'DREV-EN028', N'Naturia Beans', N'Effect Monster', 100, 1200, 2, N'EARTH', N'Plant', N'Once per turn, this card cannot be destroyed by battle. When this face-up card is selected as an attack target, inflict 500 damage to your opponent.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2985, N'DREV', 20174189, N'DREV-EN029', N'Naturia Bamboo Shoot', N'Effect Monster', 2000, 2000, 5, N'EARTH', N'Plant', N'If this card is Tribute Summoned by Tributing a "Naturia" monster, while this card remains face-up on the field, your opponent cannot activate Spell or Trap Cards.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:16'),
    (2986, N'DREV', 53162898, N'DREV-EN030', N'Amazoness Sage', N'Effect Monster', 1400, 700, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'At the end of the Damage Step, if this card attacked and is still on the field: Target 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls; destroy that target.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2987, N'DREV', 89567993, N'DREV-EN031', N'Amazoness Trainee', N'Effect Monster', 1500, 1300, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'Monsters destroyed by battle with this card are returned to the bottom of the Deck instead of going to the GY. If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle: It gains 200 ATK.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2988, N'DREV', 15951532, N'DREV-EN032', N'Amazoness Queen', N'Effect Monster', 2400, 1800, 6, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'"Amazoness" monsters you control cannot be destroyed by battle.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2989, N'DREV', 52346240, N'DREV-EN033', N'Lock Cat', N'Effect Monster', 1200, 1000, 3, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'When this card is Normal Summoned, you can select 1 Level 1 Beast-Type monster in your Graveyard and Special Summon it in face-up Defense Position. Its effects are negated.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2990, N'DREV', 88845345, N'DREV-EN034', N'Elephun', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 500, 300, 2, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can select 1 of your Level 3 or lower Beast-Type, Beast-Warrior-Type or Winged Beast-Type monsters that is removed from play, and add it to your hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2991, N'DREV', 15839054, N'DREV-EN035', N'Synchro Fusionist', N'Effect Monster', 800, 600, 2, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'If this card is sent to the Graveyard as a Synchro Material Monster, you can add 1 Spell Card from your Deck to your hand with "Polymerization" or "Fusion" in the card name, except "Diffusion Wave-Motion".', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2992, N'DREV', 41224658, N'DREV-EN036', N'Ambitious Gofer', N'Effect Monster', 2400, 100, 6, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'Once per turn: You can target up to 2 monsters your opponent controls; your opponent can reveal 1 monster in their hand to negate this card''s effect, otherwise destroy those monsters.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2993, N'DREV', 87622767, N'DREV-EN037', N'Final Psychic Ogre', N'Effect Monster', 2200, 1700, 5, N'EARTH', N'Psychic', N'If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle, you can pay 800 Life Points to select 1 Psychic-Type monster in your Graveyard, and add it to your hand.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2994, N'DREV', 14017402, N'DREV-EN038', N'Dragon Knight Draco-Equiste', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 3200, 2000, 10, N'WIND', N'Dragon', N'1 Dragon-Type Synchro Monster + 1 Warrior-Type monster
Must first be Fusion Summoned. Once per turn: You can target 1 Dragon-Type Synchro Monster in the Graveyard; banish that target, and if you do, until the End Phase, this card''s name becomes that monster''s, and replace this effect with that monster''s original effects. While this card is in Attack Position, your opponent takes any effect damage you would have taken from their card effects, instead.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2995, N'DREV', 40101111, N'DREV-EN039', N'Ultimate Axon Kicker', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2900, 1700, 10, N'LIGHT', N'Psychic', N'1 Psychic-Type Synchro Monster + 1 Psychic-Type monster
This monster can only be Special Summoned by Fusion Summon (from the Extra Deck). This card cannot be destroyed by card effects. During battle between this attacking card and a Defense Position monster whose DEF is lower than the ATK of this card, inflict the difference as Battle Damage to your opponent. When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard, you gain Life Points equal to the destroyed monster''s ATK.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2996, N'DREV', 77506119, N'DREV-EN040', N'Thunder Unicorn', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2200, 1800, 5, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'1 Beast-Type Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters
Once per turn, during your Main Phase, you can select 1 face-up monster your opponent controls. It loses 500 ATK for each monster you control, until the End Phase. During the turn this effect is activated, no other monsters can attack, except this card.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2997, N'DREV', 13995824, N'DREV-EN041', N'Voltic Bicorn', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2500, 2000, 7, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'1 Beast-Type Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters
If this card is destroyed by your opponent''s card (either by battle or by card effect), both players send the top 7 cards of their Deck to the Graveyard.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2998, N'DREV', 49389523, N'DREV-EN042', N'Lightning Tricorn', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2800, 2000, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Beast', N'1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner Beast-Type monsters
If this card is destroyed by your opponent''s card (either by battle or by card effect), you can select 1 "Thunder Unicorn" or "Voltic Bicorn" in your Graveyard and Special Summon it.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (2999, N'DREV', 76774528, N'DREV-EN043', N'Scrap Dragon', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 2800, 2000, 8, N'EARTH', N'Dragon', N'1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters
Once per turn: You can target 1 card you control and 1 card your opponent controls; destroy them. When this card in your possession is destroyed by your opponent''s card and sent to your GY: Target 1 non-Synchro "Scrap" monster in your GY; Special Summon that target.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (3000, N'DREV', 2772236, N'DREV-EN044', N'Wattchimera', N'Synchro Effect Monster', 1400, 1200, 6, N'LIGHT', N'Thunder', N'1 "Watt" Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner Thunder-Type monsters
This card can attack your opponent directly. When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent by a direct attack, place 1 random card from your opponent''s hand on top of their Deck.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17');
