    (3062, N'STBL', 70630741, N'STBL-EN006', N'Rescue Warrior', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1700, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'You take no Battle Damage from battles involving this card. If this card is destroyed by battle, select 1 face-up monster your opponent controls that you own, and take control of it.', N'COMMON', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
