    (3065, N'STBL', 79418153, N'STBL-EN009', N'Lancer Archfiend', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1400, 4, N'DARK', N'Fiend', N'Once per turn, when your monster declares an attack on your opponent''s Defense Position monster: You can activate this effect; during that battle, if that monster attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage to your opponent.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
    (3066, N'STBL', 6903857, N'STBL-EN010', N'Power Breaker', N'Effect Monster', 1900, 0, 4, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'If this card in your possession is destroyed by your opponent''s attack or card effect and sent to your Graveyard: Target 1 face-up Spell/Trap Card your opponent controls; destroy that target. If this card attacks, it is changed to Defense Position at the end of the Damage Step.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:17'),
