    (3350, N'EXVC', 31930787, N'EXVC-EN094', N'Meklord Emperor Skiel', N'Effect Monster', 2200, 2200, 1, N'WIND', N'Machine', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned by its own effect, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. When a face-up monster you control is destroyed by a card effect and sent to the Graveyard (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from your hand. Other monsters you control cannot declare an attack. Once per turn: You can target 1 Synchro Monster your opponent controls; equip that target to this card. This card gains ATK equal to the combined ATK of the monsters equipped to it by this effect. You can send 1 monster you control that is equipped to this card to the Graveyard; this card can attack your opponent directly this turn.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3351, N'EXVC', 67328336, N'EXVC-EN095', N'Meklord Fortress', N'Field Spell', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Field', N'"Meklord Emperor" monsters you control cannot be targeted by the effects of Synchro Monsters. When this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard: You can add 1 "Meklord Emperor" monster from your Deck to your hand.', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3352, N'EXVC', 38562933, N'EXVC-EN096', N'Blackwing - Jin the Rain Shadow', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 600, 500, 1, N'DARK', N'Winged Beast', N'If this card battles a face-up monster with DEF equal to or less than this card''s ATK, destroy that monster at the start of the Damage Step (without damage calculation).', N'RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3353, N'EXVC', 64550682, N'EXVC-EN097', N'Scrap Orthros', N'Tuner Effect Monster', 1700, 1100, 4, N'EARTH', N'Beast', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) while you control a "Scrap" monster. If Summoned this way: Target 1 "Scrap" monster you control; destroy that target. If this card is destroyed by the effect of a "Scrap" card and sent to the GY: You can target 1 "Scrap" monster in your GY, except "Scrap Orthros"; add that target to your hand.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3354, N'EXVC', 37349495, N'EXVC-EN098', N'Naturia Eggplant', N'Effect Monster', 1000, 700, 2, N'EARTH', N'Plant', N'When this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard, you can select 1 "Naturia" monster in your Graveyard, except "Naturia Eggplant", and add it to your hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3355, N'EXVC', 98884569, N'EXVC-EN099', N'Blue Rose Dragon', N'Effect Monster', 1600, 1200, 4, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'When this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the GY: You can target 1 "Black Rose Dragon" or 1 Plant monster in your GY; Special Summon that monster.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 1, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3356, N'DRLG', 1784686, N'DRLG-001', N'The Eye of Timaeus', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'(This card is also always treated as "Legendary Dragon Timaeus".)
Target 1 "Dark Magician" monster you control; Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck that mentions that monster on the field as material, using it as the Fusion Material.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3357, N'DRLG', 11082056, N'DRLG-002', N'The Fang of Critias', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'(This card is also always treated as "Legendary Dragon Critias".)
Send 1 Trap from your hand or field to the GY, that is listed on a Fusion Monster that can only be Special Summoned with "The Fang of Critias" (if that card is Set, reveal it); Special Summon that Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3358, N'DRLG', 46232525, N'DRLG-003', N'The Claw of Hermos', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'(This card is also always treated as "Legendary Dragon Hermos".)
Send 1 monster from your hand or field to the GY, of the Type that is listed on a Fusion Monster that can only be Special Summoned with "The Claw of Hermos"; Special Summon that Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3359, N'DRLG', 89397517, N'DRLG-004', N'Legend of Heart', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'Pay 1000 LP, then Tribute 1 Warrior monster; banish up to 3 "Legendary Dragon" Spells with different names from your hand and/or GY, and if you do, Special Summon that many "Legendary Knight" monsters with different names from your hand and/or GY. When this card resolves, you can banish 1 face-up Spell/Trap on the field.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3360, N'DRLG', 80019195, N'DRLG-005', N'Legendary Knight Timaeus', N'Effect Monster', 2800, 1800, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned with "Legend of Heart". When this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 face-up Spell/Trap on the field; banish that target. When this card is targeted for an attack: You can target 1 Spell in your GY; Set that target.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3361, N'DRLG', 85800949, N'DRLG-006', N'Legendary Knight Critias', N'Effect Monster', 2800, 1800, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned with "Legend of Heart". When this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 face-up Spell/Trap on the field; banish that target. When this card is targeted for an attack: You can target 1 Trap in your GY; Set that target.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3362, N'DRLG', 84565800, N'DRLG-007', N'Legendary Knight Hermos', N'Effect Monster', 2800, 1800, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned with "Legend of Heart". When this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 face-up Spell/Trap on the field; banish that target. When this card is targeted for an attack: You can target 1 Effect Monster in your GY; this card gains that monster''s effects until the End Phase.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3363, N'DRLG', 43892408, N'DRLG-008', N'Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2600, 1700, 7, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'"Dark Magician Girl" + 1 Dragon monster (o "The Eye of Timaeus")
Once per turn: You can send 1 card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 face-up card on the field; destroy that target.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3364, N'DRLG', 75380687, N'DRLG-009', N'Amulet Dragon', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2900, 2500, 8, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'"Dark Magician" + 1 Dragon monster (o "The Eye of Timaeus")
If Special Summoned: Target any number of Spell Cards in any GY (min. 1); banish those targets, and if you do, this card gains 100 ATK for each card banished. If this card is destroyed: You can target 1 Spellcaster monster in your GY; Special Summon that target.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3365, N'DRLG', 84687358, N'DRLG-010', N'Mirror Force Dragon', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2800, 1200, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Dragon', N'Must be Special Summoned with "The Fang of Critias", using "Mirror Force".
