    (3366, N'DRLG', 22804644, N'DRLG-011', N'Doom Virus Dragon', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 1900, 1500, 4, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'Must be Special Summoned with "The Fang of Critias", using "Crush Card Virus".
If this card is Special Summoned: Look at your opponent''s hand, all monsters they control, and destroy all those monsters with 1500 or more ATK.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3367, N'DRLG', 58293343, N'DRLG-012', N'Tyrant Burst Dragon', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2900, 2500, 8, N'LIGHT', N'Dragon', N'Must be Special Summoned with "The Fang of Critias", using "Tyrant Wing".
This card can attack all opponent''s monsters once each. You can target 1 face-up monster you control; equip this card to that target. It gains 400 ATK/DEF, also it can make 3 attacks during each Battle Phase.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3368, N'DRLG', 19747827, N'DRLG-013', N'Red-Eyes Black Dragon Sword', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 2400, 2000, 7, N'DARK', N'Dragon', N'Must be Special Summoned with "The Claw of Hermos", sending a Dragon monster from your hand or field to the GY.
If this card is Special Summoned: Target 1 other face-up monster on the field; equip this card to it. It gains 1000 ATK, plus 500 ATK/DEF for each Dragon monster on the field and in the GYs.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3369, N'DRLG', 10960419, N'DRLG-014', N'Time Magic Hammer', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 500, 400, 2, N'LIGHT', N'Spellcaster', N'Must be Special Summoned with "The Claw of Hermos", sending a Spellcaster monster from your hand or field to the GY.
If this card is Special Summoned: Target 1 other face-up monster on the field; equip this card to it. At the start of the Damage Step, if it battles an opponent''s monster: You can roll a six-sided die, and banish that opponent''s monster.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3370, N'DRLG', 83743222, N'DRLG-015', N'Goddess Bow', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 1500, 1600, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Aqua', N'Must be Special Summoned with "The Claw of Hermos", sending an Aqua monster from your hand or field to the GY.
If this card is Special Summoned: Target 1 other face-up monster on the field; equip this card to it. During the Battle Phase, if an opponent''s card effect is activated, negate that effect, also the equipped monster can make a second attack during this Battle Phase.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3371, N'DRLG', 46354113, N'DRLG-016', N'Rocket Hermos Cannon', N'Fusion Effect Monster', 1500, 1300, 4, N'LIGHT', N'Warrior', N'Must be Special Summoned with "The Claw of Hermos", sending a Warrior monster from your hand or field to the GY.
