    (3376, N'PROMO-DM', 75347539, N'PROMO-005', N'Valkyrion the Magna Warrior', N'Effect Monster', 3500, 3850, 8, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by Tributing 1 "Alpha The Magnet Warrior", "Beta The Magnet Warrior", and "Gamma The Magnet Warrior" from your hand and/or field. You can Tribute this card, then target 1 "Alpha The Magnet Warrior", "Beta The Magnet Warrior", and "Gamma The Magnet Warrior" in your GY; Special Summon them.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3377, N'PROMO-DM', 99785935, N'PROMO-006', N'Alpha The Magnet Warrior', N'Normal Monster', 1400, 1700, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'Alpha, Beta, and Gamma meld together to form a powerful monster.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3378, N'PROMO-DM', 39256679, N'PROMO-007', N'Beta The Magnet Warrior', N'Normal Monster', 1700, 1600, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'Alpha, Beta, and Gamma meld together to form a powerful monster.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3379, N'PROMO-DM', 11549357, N'PROMO-008', N'Gamma The Magnet Warrior', N'Normal Monster', 1500, 1800, 4, N'EARTH', N'Rock', N'Alpha, Beta, and Gamma meld together to form a powerful monster.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3380, N'PROMO-DM', 18144506, N'PROMO-009', N'Harpie''s Feather Duster', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'Destroy all Spells and Traps your opponent controls.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3381, N'PROMO-DM', 5556668, N'PROMO-010', N'Exchange', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'Both players reveal their hands and add 1 card from each other''s hand to their hand.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3382, N'PROMO-DM', 12600382, N'PROMO-011', N'Exodia Necross', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 0, 4, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned with "Contract with Exodia", and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. Cannot be destroyed by battle or Spell/Trap effect. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: This card gains 500 ATK. Destroy this card unless all 5 of these cards are in your Graveyard - "Exodia the Forbidden One", "Right Arm of the Forbidden One", "Left Arm of the Forbidden One", "Right Leg of the Forbidden One" and "Left Leg of the Forbidden One".', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3383, N'PROMO-DM', 33244944, N'PROMO-012', N'Contract with Exodia', N'Normal Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'If you have all 5 of "Exodia the Forbidden One", "Right Arm of the Forbidden One", "Left Arm of the Forbidden One", "Right Leg of the Forbidden One", and "Left Leg of the Forbidden One" in your Graveyard: Special Summon 1 "Exodia Necross" from your hand.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3384, N'PROMO-DM', 48179391, N'PROMO-013', N'The Seal of Orichalcos', N'Field Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'All monsters you control gain 500 ATK. Once per turn, this card cannot be destroyed by card effects. While you control 2 or more face-up Attack Position monsters, your opponent cannot target your monster(s) with the lowest ATK for an attack. If this card is activated: Destroy all Special Summoned monsters you control (if any). You cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck. You can only activate "The Seal of Orichalcos" once per Duel.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3385, N'PROMO-DM', 57728570, N'PROMO-014', N'Crush Card Virus', N'Normal Trap', NULL, NULL, 0, N'TRAP', N'Trap', N'Tribute 1 DARK monster with 1000 or less ATK; your opponent takes no damage until the end of the next turn after this card resolves, also, you look at your opponent''s hand and all monsters they control, and if you do, destroy the monsters among them with 1500 or more ATK, then your opponent can destroy up to 3 monsters with 1500 or more ATK in their Deck.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3386, N'PROMO-DM', 80316585, N'PROMO-015', N'Cyber Harpie Lady', N'Effect Monster', 1800, 1300, 4, N'WIND', N'Winged Beast', N'(This card''s name is always treated as "Harpie Lady".)', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3387, N'PROMO-DM', 30208479, N'PROMO-016', N'Magician of Black Chaos', N'Ritual Monster', 2800, 2600, 8, N'DARK', N'Spellcaster', N'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Black Magic Ritual".', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3388, N'PROMO-DM', 41426869, N'PROMO-017', N'Black Illusion Ritual', N'Ritual Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'This card is used to Ritual Summon "Relinquished". You must also Tribute a monster from your hand or field whose Level is 1 or more.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3389, N'PROMO-DM', 5405694, N'PROMO-018', N'Black Luster Soldier', N'Ritual Monster', 3000, 2500, 8, N'EARTH', N'Warrior', N'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Black Luster Ritual".', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3390, N'PROMO-DM', 55761792, N'PROMO-019', N'Black Luster Ritual', N'Ritual Spell', NULL, NULL, 0, N'SPELL', N'Spell', N'This card is used to Ritual Summon "Black Luster Soldier". You must also Tribute monsters from your hand or field whose total Levels equal 8 or more.', N'SUPER_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3391, N'PROMO-DM', 48579379, N'PROMO-020', N'Perfectly Ultimate Great Moth', N'Effect Monster', 3500, 3000, 8, N'EARTH', N'Insect', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by Tributing 1 "Petit Moth" on your 6th turn or later after it was equipped with "Cocoon of Evolution".', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3392, N'PROMO-DM', 25833572, N'PROMO-021', N'Gate Guardian', N'Effect Monster', 3750, 3400, 11, N'DARK', N'Warrior', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by Tributing 1 "Sanga of the Thunder", "Kazejin", and "Suijin".', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3393, N'GODS-EGY', 10000000, N'GOD-001', N'Obelisk the Tormentor', N'Effect Monster', 4000, 4000, 10, N'DIVINE', N'Divine-Beast', N'Requires 3 Tributes to Normal Summon (cannot be Normal Set). This card''s Normal Summon cannot be negated. When Normal Summoned, cards and effects cannot be activated. Neither player can target this card with card effects. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card was Special Summoned: Send it to the GY. You can Tribute 2 monsters; destroy all monsters your opponent controls. This card cannot declare an attack the turn this effect is activated.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3394, N'GODS-EGY', 10000010, N'GOD-002', N'The Winged Dragon of Ra', N'Effect Monster', -2, -2, 10, N'DIVINE', N'Divine-Beast', N'Cannot be Special Summoned. Requires 3 Tributes to Normal Summon (cannot be Normal Set). This card''s Normal Summon cannot be negated. When Normal Summoned, other cards and effects cannot be activated. When this card is Normal Summoned: You can pay LP so that you only have 100 left; this card gains ATK/DEF equal to the amount of LP paid. You can pay 1000 LP, then target 1 monster on the field; destroy that target.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3395, N'GODS-EGY', 10000020, N'GOD-003', N'Slifer the Sky Dragon', N'Effect Monster', -2, -2, 10, N'DIVINE', N'Divine-Beast', N'Requires 3 Tributes to Normal Summon (cannot be Normal Set). This card''s Normal Summon cannot be negated. When Normal Summoned, cards and effects cannot be activated. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card was Special Summoned: Send it to the GY. Gains 1000 ATK/DEF for each card in your hand. If a monster(s) is Normal or Special Summoned to your opponent''s field in Attack Position: That monster(s) loses 2000 ATK, then if its ATK has been reduced to 0 as a result, destroy it.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3396, N'GODS-EGY', 10000080, N'GOD-004', N'The Winged Dragon of Ra - Sphere Mode', N'Effect Monster', -2, -2, 10, N'DIVINE', N'Divine-Beast', N'Cannot be Special Summoned. Requires 3 Tributes from either side of the field to Normal Summon to that side of the field (cannot be Normal Set), then shift control to this card''s owner during the End Phase of the next turn. Cannot attack. Your opponent cannot target this card with card effects, also monsters your opponent controls cannot target this card for attacks. You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 "The Winged Dragon of Ra" from your hand or Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions, and if you do, its ATK/DEF become 4000.

* The above text is unofficial and describes the card''s functionality in the OCG.', N'ULTRA_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18'),
    (3397, N'GODS-EGY', 10000090, N'GOD-005', N'The Winged Dragon of Ra - Immortal Phoenix', N'Effect Monster', 4000, 4000, 10, N'DIVINE', N'Divine-Beast', N'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned by its own effect. If "The Winged Dragon of Ra" is sent from the field to your GY while this card is in your GY: Special Summon this card. Cards and effects cannot be activated in response to this effect''s activation. This card is unaffected by other cards'' effects. You can pay 1000 LP; send 1 monster on the field to the GY. Once per turn, during the End Phase: Send this card to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon 1 "The Winged Dragon of Ra - Sphere Mode" from your hand, Deck, or GY, ignoring its Summoning conditions.', N'SECRET_RARE', 1, 1, 1, 0, '2026-10-12 12:22:18');
