    (89882100, N'Night Beam', N'Target 1 Set Spell/Trap your opponent controls; destroy that target. Your opponent cannot activate the targeted card in response to this card''s activation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Selecciona 1 Mágica/Trampa Colocada que controle tu adversario; destruye ese objetivo. Tu adversario no puede activar la carta seleccionada en respuesta a la activación de esta carta.', N'Rayo Nocturno'),
    (89883517, N'Mistaken Accusation', N'If your opponent has more total cards in their hand and field than you do: Target 1 face-up card on the field; neither player can activate cards with that name, or their effects, for the rest of this Duel, except that target. You can only activate 1 "Mistaken Accusation" per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Si tu adversario tiene más cartas en total que tú en su mano y su Campo: selecciona 1 carta boca arriba en el Campo; por el resto de este Duelo, ningún jugador puede activar cartas con ese nombre, ni sus efectos, excepto ese objetivo. Sólo puedes activar 1 "Acusación Errónea" por turno.', N'Acusación Errónea'),
    (89893715, N'Laval Miller', N'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard: You can send 2 "Laval" monsters from your Deck to the Graveyard.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Cuando esta carta es destruída en batalla y mandada al Cementerio: puedes mandar al Cementerio, desde tu Deck, 2 monstruos "Laval".', N'Molinero Laval'),
    (89899996, N'D - Spirit', N'Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Destiny HERO" monster from your hand. You must not control any "Destiny HERO" monsters to activate and to resolve this effect.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Invoca de Modo Especial, desde tu mano, 1 monstruo "HÉROE del Destino" de Nivel 4 o menor. No debes controlar monstruos "HÉROE del Destino" para activar y resolver este efecto.', N'Espíritu del Destino'),
    (89904598, N'Anthrosaurus', N'Dis man-like dinosawz gotta high I.Q., even tho he''s lackin'' in da strength depawtment. (Kinda like yooz, if ya had a high I.Q.! Nyaah!)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Este dinozaurio ke camina tiene alta inteligencia, aunke sea un poko débil en el azpecto fízico. (¡Un poko como tú, zi tú fuera'' inteligente! ¡Naaah!).', N'Anthrosaurio'),
    (89907227, N'White Aura Bihamut', N'1 Tuner Synchro Monster + 1+ non-Tuner monsters
During your turn, when this card is Synchro Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 "Divine Dragon Token" (Fish/WATER/Level 10/ATK 3300/DEF 3000) in Defense Position. Once per opponent''s turn, while you control no Tokens (Quick Effect): You can Special Summon 1 "Divine Dragon Token". If this card you control is destroyed by an opponent''s card effect and sent to your GY, while you control a "Divine Dragon Token": You can Special Summon this card in Defense Position.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'1 Monstruo de Sincronía Cantante + 1+ monstruos que no sean Cantantes
Durante tu turno, cuando esta carta es Invocada por Sincronía: puedes Invocar de Modo Especial 1 "Ficha Dragón Divino" (Pez/AGUA/Nivel 10/ATK 3300/DEF 3000) en Posición de Defensa. Una vez por turno del adversario, mientras no controles Fichas (Efecto Rápido): puedes Invocar de Modo Especial 1 "Ficha Dragón Divino". Si esta carta que controlas es destruida por efecto de una carta del adversario y mandada a tu Cementerio mientras controlas una "Ficha Dragón Divino": puedes Invocar esta carta de Modo Especial en Posición de Defensa.', N'Bihamut de Aura Blanca'),
    (89907228, N'Divine Dragon Token', N'Special Summoned with the effect of "White Aura Bihamut".', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Invocada de Modo Especial con el efecto de "Bihamut de Aura Blanca".', N'Ficha Dragón Divino'),
    (89914395, N'Divine Relic Mjollnir', N'Target 1 "Aesir" monster you control; it can make a second attack during each Battle Phase this turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Selecciona 1 monstruo "Aesir" que controles; este turno, éste puede hacer un segundo ataque durante cada Battle Phase.', N'Reliquia Divina Mjollnir'),
    (89928517, N'Two-for-One Team', N'Once per turn: You can make both players show 1 card from their hands, and if both the shown cards are the same type of card, apply 1 of these effects, depending on the type.
● Monster: Each player can Special Summon their monster.
● Spell: Each player draws 2 cards.
● Trap: Each player sends exactly 2 cards from their Deck to their GY.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Una vez por turno: puedes hacer que ambos jugadores enseñen 1 carta en sus manos, y si ambas cartas enseñadas son del mismo tipo de carta, aplica 1 de estos efectos, dependiendo del tipo.
●  Monstruo: Cada jugador puede Invocar a su monstruo de Modo Especial.
●  Mágica: Cada jugador roba 2 cartas.
●  Trampa: Cada jugador manda a su Cementerio exactamente 2 cartas en su Deck.', N'Equipo de Dos por Uno'),
    (89932017, N'One-Way Synchro', N'Take 1 Level 1 Tuner from your Deck or GY, and either add it to your hand or Special Summon it. If you control "Junk Warrior" or a monster that mentions it, and this card is in your GY: You can Set this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use 1 "One-Way Synchro" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Add to your hand, or Special Summon, 1 Level 1 Tuner from your Deck or GY. If this card is in your GY and you control "Junk Warrior" or a monster that mentions it: You can Set this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use 1 "Synchro Oneway" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', N'Synchro Oneway'),
    (89943723, N'Elemental HERO Neos', N'A new Elemental HERO has arrived from Neo-Space! When he initiates a Contact Fusion with a Neo-Spacian his unknown powers are unleashed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'¡Un nuevo HÉROE Elemental ha llegado desde el Neo Espacio! Cuando inicia una Fusión de Contacto con un Neo Espacial sus desconocidos poderes son liberados.', N'HÉROE Elemental Neos'),
    (89943724, N'Elemental HERO Neos', N'A new Elemental HERO has arrived from Neo-Space! When he initiates a Contact Fusion with a Neo-Spacian his unknown powers are unleashed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'¡Un nuevo HÉROE Elemental ha llegado desde el Neo Espacio! Cuando inicia una Fusión de Contacto con un Neo Espacial sus desconocidos poderes son liberados.', N'HÉROE Elemental Neos'),
    (89943725, N'Elemental HERO Neos', N'A new Elemental HERO has arrived from Neo-Space! When he initiates a Contact Fusion with a Neo-Spacian his unknown powers are unleashed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'¡Un nuevo HÉROE Elemental ha llegado desde el Neo Espacio! Cuando inicia una Fusión de Contacto con un Neo Espacial sus desconocidos poderes son liberados.', N'HÉROE Elemental Neos'),
    (89943726, N'Elemental HERO Neos', N'A new Elemental HERO has arrived from Neo-Space! When he initiates a Contact Fusion with a Neo-Spacian his unknown powers are unleashed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'¡Un nuevo HÉROE Elemental ha llegado desde el Neo Espacio! Cuando inicia una Fusión de Contacto con un Neo Espacial sus desconocidos poderes son liberados.', N'HÉROE Elemental Neos'),
    (89948817, N'Jurrac Volcano', N'During your Main Phase: You can destroy 1 Dinosaur monster you control, and if you do, Special Summon 1 "Jurrac" monster from your Deck. If your opponent Special Summons a monster(s) and they have activated 4 or more monster effects this turn (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 1 "Jurrac Meteor" from your Extra Deck (this is treated as a Synchro Summon). If a "Jurrac" monster(s) you control would be destroyed by card effect, you can banish 1 Dinosaur monster from your GY instead. You can only use each effect of "Jurrac Volcano" once per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Durante tu Main Phase: puedes destruir 1 monstruo Dinosaurio que controles y, si lo haces, Invoca de Modo Especial, desde tu Deck, 1 monstruo "Jurrac". Si tu adversario Invoca uno o más monstruos de Modo Especial y ha activado 4 o más efectos de monstruo este turno (excepto durante el Damage Step): puedes Invocar de Modo Especial 1 "Jurrac Meteoro" desde tu Deck Extra (esto se trata como una Invocación por Sincronía). Si uno o más monstruos "Jurrac" que controlas fueran a ser destruidos por el efecto de una carta, puedes desterrar 1 monstruo Dinosaurio en tu Cementerio en su lugar. Sólo puedes usar cada efecto de "Jurrac Volcán" una vez por turno.', N'Jurrac Volcán'),
    (89959682, N'Pharaonic Protector', N'The mummy of a soldier that has been guarding the royal family for thousands of years. Even now, its spirit does not allow anybody to trespass.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'La momia de un soldado que ha estado guardando la familia real durante miles de años. Incluso ahora, su espíritu no permite pasar a nadie.', N'Guardia Faraónico'),
    (89974735, N'Burgundy the Magic Elf', N'If a card(s) is discarded from your opponent''s hand by card effect (except during the Damage Step): You can inflict 400 damage to your opponent for each card discarded. When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: You can discard 1 random card from your opponent''s hand. You can only use each effect of "Burgundy the Magic Elf" once per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Si una o más cartas son descartadas de la mano de tu adversario por efecto de una carta mientras controlas este monstruo (excepto durante el Damage Step): puedes infligir 400 puntos de daño a tu adversario por cada carta descartada. Cuando esta carta es destruida en batalla y mandada al Cementerio: puedes descartar 1 carta al azar de la mano de tu adversario. Sólo puedes usar cada efecto de "Burgundy el Elfo Mágico" una vez por turno.', N'Burgundy el Elfo Mágico'),
    (89974904, N'Synchro Call', N'Target 1 monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it, but it has its effects negated (if any), and if you do, immediately after this effect resolves, Synchro Summon 1 DARK Dragon or Fiend-Type Synchro Monster using only monsters you control as Materials, including the Summoned monster.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Selecciona 1 monstruo en tu Cementerio; Invócalo de Modo Especial, pero éste ve sus efectos negados (si los tiene) y, si lo haces, inmediatamente después de que se resuelva este efecto, Invoca por Sincronía 1 Monstruo de Sincronía de OSCURIDAD de Tipo Dragón o Demonio usando sólo monstruos que controles como Materiales, incluyendo al monstruo Invocado.', N'Llamada de Sincronía'),
    (89987208, N'Hero of the East', N'Feel da strength ah dis sword-swingin'' samurai from da Far East.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Ziente la fuersa de este zamurai del Legano Ezte.', N'Héroe del Este'),
    (89997728, N'Toon Table of Contents', N'Add 1 "Toon" card from your Deck to your hand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Añade a tu mano 1 carta "Toon" en tu Deck.', N'Tabla de Contenidos Toon'),
    (90000652, N'Rescue-ACE Fire Engine', N'If a "Rescue-ACE" monster(s) is Normal or Special Summoned to your field, except "Rescue-ACE Fire Engine" (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If a monster(s) is Special Summoned to your opponent''s field (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Rescue-ACE" monster from your hand, Deck, or GY. You can only use each effect of "Rescue-ACE Fire Engine" once per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Si uno o más monstruos "AS-Rescate" son Invocados de Modo Normal o Especial a tu Campo, excepto "Motor de Fuego AS-Rescate" (excepto durante el Damage Step): puedes Invocar esta carta de Modo Especial desde tu mano. Si uno o más monstruos son Invocados de Modo Especial al Campo de tu adversario (excepto durante el Damage Step): puedes Invocar de Modo Especial 1 monstruo "AS-Rescate" de Nivel 4 o menor desde tu mano, Deck o Cementerio. Sólo puedes usar cada efecto de "Motor de Fuego AS-Rescate" una vez por turno.', N'Motor de Fuego AS-Rescate'),
    (90011152, N'Ojama Country', N'Once per turn: You can send 1 "Ojama" card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 "Ojama" monster in your GY; Special Summon it. While you control an "Ojama" monster, switch the original ATK/DEF of all monsters on the field.

* The above text is unofficial and describes the card''s functionality in the OCG.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Una vez por turno: puedes mandar al Cementerio 1 carta "Ojama" en tu mano, y después seleccionar 1 monstruo "Ojama" en tu Cementerio; Invócalo de Modo Especial. Mientras controles un monstruo "Ojama", intercambia los ATK/DEF originales de todos los monstruos en el Campo.

* El texto anterior no es oficial y describe la funcionalidad de la carta en el OCG.', N'País de Ojamas'),
    (90011273, N'Breachborrel Dragon', N'2 DARK Dragon monsters, including a "Rokket" monster
If this card is Link Summoned: You can add 1 "Borrel" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand. (Quick Effect): You can target 1 DARK monster you control; it gains 500 ATK, or if it is no longer on the field, you can Special Summon 1 "Rokket" monster from your Deck in Defense Position instead. You can only use each effect of "Breachborrel Dragon" once per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'2 DARK Dragon monsters, including a "Rokket" monster
If this card is Link Summoned: You can add 1 "Borrel" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand. (Quick Effect): You can target 1 DARK monster you control; it gains 500 ATK, or if it is no longer on the field, you can Special Summon 1 "Rokket" monster from your Deck in Defense Position instead. You can only use each effect of "Breachborrel Dragon" once per turn.', N'Breachborrel Dragon'),
    (90019393, N'Gem-Knight Alexandrite', N'You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 "Gem-Knight" Normal Monster from your Deck.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Puedes Sacrificar esta carta; Invoca de Modo Especial, desde tu Deck, 1 Monstruo Normal "Caballero-Gema".', N'Caballero-Gema Alexandrita'),
    (90020065, N'Jigen Bakudan', N'FLIP: After this card is flipped, offer it as a Tribute during your Standby Phase to destroy all monsters on your side of the field and inflict Direct Damage equal to half of the total ATK of the destroyed cards (excluding this monster) to your opponent''s Life Points.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'VOLTEO: Ofrece esta carta como Sacrificio durante tu Standby Phase. Destruye todos los monstruos en tu Campo e inflige daño igual a la mitad del ATK total de los monstruos destruidos a los Life Points de tu adversario.', N'Jigen Bakudan'),
    (90020780, N'Shinobi Necro', N'If another Zombie monster is Special Summoned from your GY while you control this monster (except during the Damage Step): You can draw 1 card, then discard 1 card. If this card in the GY is banished face-up to activate an effect, or by an effect: You can Special Summon this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use each effect of "Shinobi Necro" once per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Si otro monstruo Zombi es Invocado de Modo Especial desde tu Cementerio mientras controlas este monstruo (excepto durante el Damage Step): puedes robar 1 carta, y después descartar 1 carta. Si esta carta es desterrada del Cementerio boca arriba para activar un efecto, o por un efecto: puedes Invocar esta carta de Modo Especial, pero destiérrala cuando deje el Campo. Sólo puedes usar cada efecto de "Shinobi Necro" una vez por turno.', N'Shinobi Necro'),
    (90027012, N'Choju of the Trillion Hands', N'If this card is Summoned: You can add 1 Ritual Monster and 1 Ritual Spell from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Choju of the Trillion Hands" once per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Si esta carta es Invocada: puedes añadir a tu mano 1 Monstruo de Ritual y 1 Mágica de Ritual en tu Deck. Sólo puedes usar este efecto de "Choju del Trillón de Manos" una vez por turno.', N'Choju del Trillón de Manos'),
    (90036274, N'Clear Wing Fast Dragon', N'[ Pendulum Effect ]
You can send 1 face-up "Speedroid" Tuner and 1 face-up non-Tuner monster you control to the GY, whose total Levels equal 7; Special Summon this card from your Pendulum Zone. You can only use this effect of "Clear Wing Fast Dragon" once per turn.
----------------------------------------
[ Monster Effect ]
1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner WIND monsters
(Quick Effect): You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck; until the end of this turn, change its ATK to 0, also negate that face-up monster''s effects. You can only use this effect of "Clear Wing Fast Dragon" once per turn. If this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'[ Efecto de Péndulo ]
Puedes mandar al Cementerio 1 Cantante "Velociroid" boca arriba y 1 monstruo boca arriba que no sea Cantante que controles, cuyos Niveles totales sean iguales a 7; Invoca esta carta de Modo Especial desde tu Zona de Péndulo. Sólo puedes usar este efecto de "Dragón Veloz Ala Transparente" una vez por turno.
----------------------------------------
[ Efecto de Monstruo ]
1 Cantante + 1+ monstruos de VIENTO que no sean Cantantes
(Efecto Rápido): puedes seleccionar 1 monstruo boca arriba que controle tu adversario que fue Invocado de Modo Especial desde el Deck Extra; hasta el final de este turno, cambia su ATK a 0, y además niega los efectos de ese monstruo boca arriba. Sólo puedes usar este efecto de "Dragón Veloz Ala Transparente" una vez por turno. Si esta carta en la Zona de Monstruos es destruida en batalla o por efecto de una carta: puedes poner esta carta en tu Zona de Péndulo.', N'Dragón Veloz Ala Transparente'),
    (90050480, N'Elemental HERO Cosmo Neos', N'"Elemental HERO Neos" + 3 "Neo-Spacian" monsters with different Attributes
Must first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by shuffling the above cards you control into the Deck. (You do not use "Polymerization".) If this card is Special Summoned from the Extra Deck: You can activate this effect; for the rest of this turn, your opponent cannot activate cards, also cards your opponent controls cannot activate their effects. Your opponent cannot activate cards or effects in response to this effect''s activation. Once per turn, during the End Phase: Shuffle this card into the Extra Deck, and if you do, destroy all cards your opponent controls.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'"HÉROE Elemental Neos" + 3 monstruos "Neo Espacial" con Atributos diferentes
Debe ser primero Invocada de Modo Especial (desde tu Deck Extra) barajando al Deck las cartas listadas arriba que tú controlas. (No usas "Polimerización"). Si esta carta es Invocada de Modo Especial desde el Deck Extra: puedes activar este efecto; por el resto de este turno, tu adversario no puede activar cartas, y además las cartas que controle tu adversario no pueden activar sus efectos. Tu adversario no puede activar cartas o efectos en respuesta a la activación de este efecto. Una vez por turno, durante la End Phase: baraja esta carta en el Deck Extra y, si lo haces, destruye todas las cartas que controle tu adversario.', N'HÉROE Elemental Neos Cosmo'),
    (90075978, N'W Nebula Meteorite', N'Change all face-down monsters on the field to face-up Defense Position. During the End Phase this turn, change all face-up LIGHT Reptile-Type monsters you control to face-down Defense Position, then draw 1 card for each. After that, you can Special Summon 1 Level 7 or higher LIGHT Reptile-Type monster from your Deck.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Cambia todos los monstruos boca abajo en el Campo a Posición de Defensa boca arriba. Durante la End Phase de este turno, cambia todos los monstruos de LUZ de Tipo Reptil boca arriba que controles a Posición de Defensa boca abajo y roba 1 carta por cada uno. Después, puedes Invocar de Modo Especial, desde tu Deck, 1 monstruo de LUZ de Tipo Reptil y de Nivel 7 o mayor.', N'Meteorito de la Nébula W'),
    (90091224, N'Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon of the Four Heavenly Dragons', N'2 Level 4 DARK monsters
(This card is always treated as a "The Phantom Knights" card.)
If this card is Special Summoned: You can target an equal number of cards on each field; destroy them. When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card; Special Summon 1 Rank 4 DARK Xyz Monster from your Extra Deck, using this card you control (this is treated as an Xyz Summon, transfer this card''s materials). You can only use each effect of "Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon of the Four Heavenly Dragons" once per turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'2 Level 4 DARK monsters
(This card is always treated as a "The Phantom Knights" card.)
If this card is Special Summoned: You can target an equal number of cards on each field; destroy them. When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card; Special Summon 1 Rank 4 DARK Xyz Monster from your Extra Deck, using this card you control (this is treated as an Xyz Summon, transfer this card''s materials). You can only use each effect of "Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon of the Four Heavenly Dragons" once per turn.', N'Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon of the Four Heavenly Dragons'),
